(355, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Dominus regit me (Ps.22 - Textus antiquus)', 0, 'ps', NULL, NULL, 'Andrew Hinkley', '', NULL, '[[\"tex\",\"\\\\grechangedim{linepunctummorashift}{-0.02 cm}{scalable}\\r\\n\\\\gresetclivisalignment{never}\",{}],[\"gabc\",\"(f3) 1. D\\u00f3(e)mi(f)nus(h) re(h)git(h) me,(h) et(h) ni(h)hil(h) mi(h)hi(h) <b>d\\u00e9</b>(i)e(hr)rit :(h.) *(:) in(h) lo(h)co(h) p\\u00e1(h)scu(h)ae(h) i(h)bi(h) me(h) col(h//)<i>lo</i>(g)<b>c\\u00e1</b>(e fr)vit.(f.) (::) 2. Su(h)per...(h)\",{}],[\"tex\",\"2.~Super aquam refecti\\u00f3nis edu{\\\\bf c\\u00e1}vit me~:~* \\u00e1nimam meam {\\\\it con}{\\\\bf v\\u00e9r}tit.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n3.~Ded\\u00faxit me super s\\u00e9mitas ju{\\\\bf st\\u00ed}tiae~:~* propter no{\\\\it men} {\\\\bf su}um.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n4.~Nam et si ambul\\u00e1vero in m\\u00e9dio umbrae mortis, non tim\\u00e9bo {\\\\bf ma}la~:~* qu\\u00f3niam {\\\\it tu} {\\\\bf me}cum es.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n5.~Virga tua, et b\\u00e1culus {\\\\bf tu}us~:~* ipsa me con{\\\\it so}{\\\\bf l\\u00e1}ta sunt.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n6.~Par\\u00e1sti in consp\\u00e9ctu meo {\\\\bf men}sam~:~* adv\\u00e9rsus eos qui tr\\u00ed{\\\\it bu}{\\\\bf lant} me.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n7.~Impingu\\u00e1sti in \\u00f3leo caput {\\\\bf me}um~:~* et calix meus in\\u00e9brians quam {\\\\it prae}{\\\\bf cl\\u00e1}rus est!\\\\\\\\\\r\\n8.~Et miseric\\u00f3rdia tua subse{\\\\bf qu\\u00e9}tur me, * \\u00f3mnibus di\\u00e9bus vi{\\\\it tae} {\\\\bf me}ae.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n9.~Et ut inh\\u00e1bitem in domo {\\\\bf D\\u00f3}mini, * in longit\\u00fadinem {\\\\it di}{\\\\bf \\u00e9}rum.\\\\\\\\\\r\\n\\\\\\\\\\r\\n{\\\\it Et repetitur antiphona} D\\u00f3minus Jesus. {\\\\it ut supra.}\",{}]]', NULL, '2.~Super aquam refectiónis edu{\\bf cá}vit me~:~* ánimam meam {\\it con}{\\bf vér}tit.\\\\\n3.~Dedúxit me super sémitas ju{\\bf stí}tiae~:~* propter no{\\it men} {\\bf su}um.\\\\\n4.~Nam et si ambulávero in médio umbrae mortis, non timébo {\\bf ma}la~:~* quóniam {\\it tu} {\\bf me}cum es.\\\\\n5.~Virga tua, et báculus {\\bf tu}us~:~* ipsa me con{\\it so}{\\bf lá}ta sunt.\\\\\n6.~Parásti in conspéctu meo {\\bf men}sam~:~* advérsus eos qui trí{\\it bu}{\\bf lant} me.\\\\\n7.~Impinguásti in óleo caput {\\bf me}um~:~* et calix meus inébrians quam {\\it prae}{\\bf clá}rus est!\\\\\n8.~Et misericórdia tua subse{\\bf qué}tur me, * ómnibus diébus vi{\\it tae} {\\bf me}ae.\\\\\n9.~Et ut inhábitem in domo {\\bf Dó}mini, * in longitúdinem {\\it di}{\\bf é}rum.\\\\\n\\\\\n{\\it Et repetitur antiphona} Dóminus Jesus. {\\it ut supra.}', NULL, 0, NULL),
