(2235, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Te Joseph celebrent', 1, 'hy', '1', NULL, 'Andrew Hinkley', '', NULL, '\"(c4) TE(d) Jo(fe)seph(f) c\\u00e9(g\')le(h)brent(dc) \\u00e1(f)gmi(e\')na(f) ca\\u00e9(d)li(c)tum :(cd..) (;) Te(dh) cun(g)cti(fe) r\\u00e9(f\')so(g)nent(gh) chri(hg)st\\u00ed(h\')a(i)dum(j) cho(ih)ri,(h.) (:) Qui(hk) cla(ji)rus(hg) m\\u00e9(h\')ri(g)tis,(fe) jun(dg)ctus(f\') es(d) \\u00edn(e)cly(dc)tae(c.) (;) Ca(e)sto(gh) fo\\u00e9(dc)de(d\')re(e) V\\u00edr(f)gi(ed)ni.(d.) (::) \"', '2. Al(d)mo(fe) cum(f) tú(g\')mi(h)dam(dc) gér(f)mi(e\')ne(f) cón(d)ju(c)gem(cd..) (;) Ad(dh)mí(g)rans,(fe) dú(f\')bi(g)o(gh) tán(hg)ge(h\')ris(i) án(j)xi(ih)us,(h.) (:) Af(hk)flá(ji)tu(hg) sú(h\')pe(g)ri(fe) Flá(dg)mi(f\')nis(d) An(e)ge(dc)lus(c.) (;) Con(e)cé(gh)ptum(dc) pú(d\')e(e)rum(f) do(ed)cet.(d.) (::) \n3. Tu(d) na(fe)tum(f) Dó(g\')mi(h)num(dc) strin(f)gis,(e\') ad(f) éx(d)te(c)ras(cd..) (;) Ae(dh)gý(g)pti(fe) pró(f\')fu(g)gum(gh) tu(hg) sé(h\')que(i)ris(j) pla(ih)gas :(h.) (:) A(hk)mís(ji)sum(hg) Só(h\')ly(g)mis(fe) quae(dg)ris,(f\') et(d) ín(e)ve(dc)nis,(c.) (;) Mi(e)scens(gh) gáu(dc)di(d\')a(e) flé(f)ti(ed)bus.(d.) (::) \n4. Post(d) mor(fe)tem(f) ré(g\')li(h)quos(dc) sors(f) pi(e\')a(f) cón(d)se(c)crat,(cd..) (;) Pal(dh)mám(g)qu{<e>e</e>}(f\') e(e)mé(f\')ri(g)tos(gh) gló(hg)ri(h\')a(i) sús(j)ci(ih)pit :(h.) (:) Tu(hk) vi(ji)vens,(hg) Sú(h\')pe(g)ris(fe) par,(dg) frú(f\')e(d)ris(e) De(dc)o,(c.) (;) Mi(e)ra(gh) sor(dc)te(d\') be(e)á(f)ti(ed)or.(d.) (::) \n5. No(d)bis,(fe) sum(f)ma(g\') Tri(h)as,(dc) par(f)ce(e\') pre(f)cán(d)ti(c)bus :(cd..) (;) Da(dh) Jo(g)seph(fe) mé(f\')ri(g)tis(gh) sí(hg)de(h\')ra(i) scán(j)de(ih)re,(h.) (:) Ut(hk) tan(ji)dem(hg) lí(h\')ce(g)at(fe) nos(dg) ti(f\')bi(d) pér(e)pe(dc)tim(c.) (;) Gra(e)tum(gh) pró(dc)me(d\')re(e) cán(f)ti(ed)cum.(d.) (::) \nA(ded)men.(cd..) (::)', '\\begin{tabular}{ll}\n2.&Almo cum túmidam gérmine cónjugem\\\\\n&Admirans dúbio tángeris ánxius,\\\\\n&Afflátu súperi Fláminis, Angelus\\\\\n&Concéptum púerum docet.\\\\\n\\\\\n3.&Tu natum Dóminum stringis, ad éxteras\\\\\n&Aegýpti prófugum tu séqueris plagas :\\\\\n&Amíssum Sólymis quaeris et ínvenis,\\\\\n&Míscens gáudia flétibus.\\\\\n\\\\\n4.&Post mortem réliquos sors pia cónsecrat,\\\\\n&Palmámqu{\\it e} eméritos glória súscipit :\\\\\n&Tu vivens, Súperis par, frúeris Deo,\\\\\n&Mira sorte beátior.\\\\\n\\\\\n5.&Nobis, summa Trias, parce precántibus :\\\\\n&Da Joseph méritis sídera scándere\\\\\n&Ut tandem líceat nos tibi pérpetim\\\\\n&Gratum prómere cánticum. Amen.\n\\end{tabular}', NULL, 0, NULL),
