(2999, NULL, 'Solesmes 1961', 'O sola magnarum', 1, 'hy', '3', NULL, 'Andrew Hinkley', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) O(d) so(e\')la(f) ma(gh)gn\\u00e1(d)r{<e>um</e>}(e) \\u00far(eg)bi(fe)um(e.) (;) Ma(g)jor(hj) Beth(j)lem,(ji) cui(hg) c\\u00f3n(hi)ti(i)git(i.) (:) Du(h)cem(hj!kv) sa(j)l\\u00fa(ji)tis(hg) ca\\u00e9(h)li(gf)tus(e_[oh:h]d/fgh.) (;) In(d)cor(e\')po(f)r\\u00e1(gh)tum(gf) g\\u00ed(g\')gne(f)re :(e.) (::) \\r\\n2. Quem(d) stel(e\')la,(f) quae(gh) so(d)lis(eg) ro(fe)tam(e.) (;) Vin(g)cit(hj) de(j)c\\u00f3(ji)r{<e>e</e>}(h) ac(hg) l\\u00fa(hi)mi(i)ne,(i.) (:) Ve(h)n\\u00eds(hj!kv)se(j) ter(ji)ris(hg) n\\u00fan(h)ti(gf)at(e_[oh:h]d/fgh.) (;) Cum(d) car(e\')ne(f) ter(gh)r\\u00e9(gf)stri(g\') De(f)um.(e.) (::) \\r\\n3. Vi(d)d\\u00e9(e\')re(f) post(gh)qu<e>{a}m</e>(d) il(d)lum(eg) Ma(fe)gi,(e.) (;) E(g)\\u00f3(hj)a(j) pro(ji)munt(hg) m\\u00fa(hi)ne(i)ra :(i.) (:) Stra(h)t\\u00ed(hj!kv)que(j) vo(ji)tis(hg) \\u00f3f(h)fe(gf)runt(e_[oh:h]d/fgh.) (;) Thus,(d) myr(e\')rh<e>{a}m</e>(f) et(f) au(gh)rum(gf) r\\u00e9(g\')gi(f)um.(e.) (::) \\r\\n4. Re(d)gem(e\') De(f)um(gh)q<e>u{e}</e>(d) an(d)n\\u00fan(eg)ti(fe)ant(e.) (;) The(g)s\\u00e1u(hj)rus,(j) et(ji) fra(hg)grans(hi) o(i)dor(i.) (:) Thu(h)ris(hj!kv) Sa(j)ba\\u00e9(ji){<e>i</e>},(h) ac(hg) m\\u00fdr(h)rhe(gf)us(e_[oh:h]d/fgh.) (;) Pul(d)vis(e\') se(f)p\\u00fal(gh)crum(gf) pra\\u00e9(g\')do(f)cet.(e.) (::) \\r\\n5. Je(d)su,(e\') ti(f)bi(gh) sit(d) gl\\u00f3(eg)ri(fe)a,(e.) (;) Qu{<e>i</e>}(g) ap(g)pa(hj)ru(j)\\u00ed(ji)sti(hg) g\\u00e9n(hi)ti(i)bus,(i.) (:) Cum(h) Pa(hj!kv)tr{<e>e</e>}(j) et(j) al(ji)mo(hg) Sp\\u00ed(h)ri(gf)tu,(e_[oh:h]d/fgh.) (;) In(d) sem(e\')pi(f)t\\u00e9r(gh)na(gf) sa\\u00e9(g\')cu(f)la.(e.) (::) \\r\\nA(efe)men.(de..) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
