(4509, NULL, 'Solesmes 1952', 'Suscipe me Domine', 1, 'va', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)<alt> Mox surgit Professus, et extensis manibus, elevatosque habens oculos, incipit voce mediocri versum sequentem : </alt> Sus(f)ci(gh)pe(h) me,(h) Do(g\')mi(h)ne,(h.) (,) se(g)cun(h)dum(h\') e(h)lo(h\')qui(h)um(h\') tu(h)um(h.) (,) et(gh) vi(ixiv_HG\'F)vam,(f.) (:Z) <alt> Quem conclusdit genuflectus, brachiis ante pectus decussatis, et capite inclinato, dicens :</alt> et(g) non(h\') con(h)fun(g\')das(h) me(h.) (,) ab(h) ex(h\')pec(h)ta(h)ti(h\')o(f)ne(gh) me(g_f)a.(f.) (::Z)\\r\\n<alt> Ter cantat pr\\u00e6dictum versum, altiori semper voce, ac eumdem ritum servans. Et Chorus repetit toties quoties, sub eodem tono, Professo interea genuflexo et inclinate manente. Ultima vice, Cantores subdunt :</alt>Gl\\u00f3(f)ri(gh)a(h) Pa(h)tri,(h) et(gh) F\\u00ed(ixih)li(gf)o,(f.) (;) et(g) Spi(h)r\\u00ed(h\')tu(f)i(gh) San(g_f~)cto.(f.) (::Z) <alt> Et Chorus respondit :</alt>Si(f)cut(gh) e(h)rat(h\') in(h) prin(h)c\\u00ed(h\')pi(h)o,(h\'_) et(h) nunc,(h) et(gh) sem(ixivHG\'F)per,(f.) (;) et(g) in(h) s\\u01fd(h\')cu(h)la(h\') s\\u00e6(h)cu(h\')l\\u00f3(f)rum.(gh) A(g_f)men.(f.) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Require apud Ritualem Vestitionum et Professionum, pp 49-50', 0, NULL),
