(4583, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Ego sum resurrectio', 0, 'al', '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(f3)()Ant. {<sc> E</sc>}(h)<sc>go</sc>(gh) sum(f ::) re(f)sur(g)r\\u00e9c(f)ti(e)o(f) et(h) vi(fg)ta(fe :) qui(h) cre(ij)dit(i) in(hi) me,(h ;) \\u00e9(hi)ti(h)am(h) si(h) m\\u00f3r(i)tu-(h)us(g) f\\u00fa(e)e(f)rit,(ghg) vi-(f)vet:(f :) et(i) om(ihi)nis,(f ;4) qui(f) vi(h)vit(g) et(f) cre(g)dit(f) in(f) me,(e ;) non(f) mo-(e)ri(f)\\u00e9(h)tur(gh) in(i) \\u00e6-(hg)t\\u00e9r(f)num.(f ::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'Benedictus ant. in the Office of the Dead.', 0, NULL),
(4584, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Benedictus Redemptor', 0, 'an', '5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3) Be(d)ne(ef)d\\u00ed(gx/gvFE/e)ctus(d ::) Re(f)d\\u00e9m(h)ptor(ih) \\u00f3m(f)ni(gh)um,(h ;) qui(h) sa(ik)l\\u00fa(kj)ti(i) pr\\u00f3(k)vi(kj)dens(ih) h\\u00f3(i/jkj)mi(ih)num,(h ;) mun(gx/h/hg~)do(fvED) de(ef)dit(f ;3) san(hiHG)ctum(fef) Do(d)m\\u00ed(gx/e/fgf)ni(ed)cum.(d ::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'For a memory of St Dominic during the octave of his feast;  in the reformed rite, an alternative antiphon for the Benedictus on his feast.', 0, NULL),
(4585, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Clementissime Domine', 1, 'an', '3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)C<sc>le(g)men(hj)t\\u00eds(j)si(ji)me</sc>(hg) (::) D\\u00f3(h/iji)mi(hg)ne,(g)(;) qui(g) pro(hj) nos(j)tra(ji) (,6) mi(h)s\\u00e9(h)ri(g)a(ix/hi/HG) (,) ab(f) im(f)pi(d)\\u00f3(e)rum(f) m\\u00e1(g)ni(h)bus(g) (,) mor(iy/ihj)tis(ji) (,4) sup(hg)pl\\u00ed(h)ci(g)um(f) per(gh)tu(gf)l\\u00eds(e)ti(e) (:) l\\u00ed(g)be(hj)ra(j) (,6) \\u00e1(jvIH)ni(i)mam(jk) e(kvJI)-ius(i) (;) ab(g) in(hj)f\\u00e9r(j)ni(ji) (,4) vo(hg)r\\u00e1(h/iji)gi(hg)ne,(g) (;) et(ed) de(g) mi(hj)nis(j)tris(ji) (,4) tar(h)t\\u00e1(h)re(g)is(ix/hg/hi/HG) (;) mi(fe)se(d)r\\u00e1(ef)tor(gh) (,4) ab(fgf)s\\u00f3l(e)ve:(e) (:) et(ed) cun(g)cta(hj) (,6) e-(j)ius(iy/ji) pec(hg)c\\u00e1(h/iji)ta(hg) (;) o(gd)bli(g)vi(hj)\\u00f3(j)ne(ji) (,4) per(h)p\\u00e9(hg)tu(h)a(hih) de-(g)le(g) (:) e(j)\\u00e1m-(jIH)que(h) (,4) ad(h) lu(ji)cem(jk) tu(kj)am(ji) An(k)ge(kl)li(jkj) tra(i)dant,(i) (;) Pa(g)ra(hj)di(j)s\\u00ed(ji)que(hg) (,4) j\\u00e1(h/iji)nu(hg)am(gh) (,4) in(i)tro(hih)d\\u00fa(g)cant.(g)(:) <alt>Cantores</alt>Ut(ed) dum(g) cor(hj)p\\u00fas(j)cu(jIH)lum(h) (,4) p\\u00fal(h)ve(hiHG)ri(hg) (,4) tr\\u00e1(fe)di(d)tur,(e) (:)<alt>Conventus</alt>ad(fe) \\u00e6-(d)ter(e)ni(f)t\\u00e1(gf)tem(gh) (,4) per(gf)d\\u00fa(e)cant.(e)()(:)<alt>Omnes genua flectant</alt>D\\u00f3(j)mi(jIH)ne,(h) (,) mi(g)se(g)r\\u00e9(hi)re(hg) (,4)   su(e)per[vel peccatr\\u00edce](f) pec(gh)ca(gf)t\\u00f3(e)re.(e) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Also occurs in the 1985 <i>Proprium</i> with the title <i>Ad ultimam Commendationem et Valedictionem</i>.', 0, NULL),
(4586, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Ave Regina Caelorum', 1, 'an', '6', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c2)A(ex/fvED/e)ve(c/df ::) Re(f)g\\u00ed(gh)na(h) c\\u00e6(gh)l\\u00f3(ivHG/g)rum;(f :) A(fvED/e)ve(c/df ;4) D\\u00f3(f)mi(gh)na(h) An(h)ge(gh)l\\u00f3(ivHG/g)rum.(f :) Sal(fg/hi)ve(h ;3) ra(ji)dix(hvGF) sanc(ghg/gV>)ta,(f :) Ex(f) qua(ef) mun(cd/f/fg)do(f ;4) lux(f) est(gh) or(ivHG/gV>)ta.(f :) Gau(f)de(hj) glor(ji)i(hvGF)\\u00f3s(ghg/g)a,(f :) Su(f)per(ef) om(cd/f/fg)nes(f ;4) spe(f)ci(gh)\\u00f3(ivHG/g)sa.(f :) Va(fg/hi)le,(h ;3) val(ji~)de(hg) de(f)c\\u00f3r(ghg)a,(h :) Et(h) pro(gh) no(ivHG/g)bis(f ;3) sem(g)per(fe) Chris(dc)tum(f ;) ex(gh)\\u00f3(ivHG/g)ra.(f) T.P.(::) Al(exfe~)le(d!efc;2c!df//gh;jkJIHGF)l\\u00fa(ghggV>)ja.(gf) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'In the <i>very</i> early days of the Order, it was often sung after Compline; soon it was supplanted by the <i>Salve Regina</i>.  It originated as a chant for the Assumption.  Notice that the text varies a little from the OSB version.', 0, NULL),
(4587, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Gaude Mater Ecclesia', 1, 'hy', '7', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)\\r\\n ()G<sc>au</sc>(e)<sc>de</sc>(fvED ::) Ma(e)ter(f) Ec(e)cl\\u00e9(f/ghg)si(gf)a,(fe ;)\\r\\nL\\u00e6(g)tam(iji) a(h)gens(gf) mem(e)\\u00f3(fe)ri(d)am,(e :)\\r\\nQu\\u00e6(g) no(i)v\\u00e6(i) pro(j)lis(i) g\\u00e1u(h)di(g)a(fge ;)\\r\\nMit(e)tis(fvED) ad(e) c\\u00e6(f)li(e) c\\u00fa(f/ghg)ri(fe)am.(e ::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, 'Prædicatórum Ordinis \nDux et Pater Domínicus,\nMundi jam fulget términis, \nCivis efféctus cælicus.\n\nCarnis liber ergástulo\nCæli potitur glória : \nPro paupertátis cíngulo \nStola dotátur régia.\n\nFragráns odor de túmulo, \nCum virtútum frequéntia \nClamat pro Christi fámulo \nSummi Regis magnália.\n\nTrino Deo et símplici \nLaus, honor, virtus, glória, \nQui nos prece Domínici \nDucat ad cæli gáudia. Amen.\n', 'Hymn for the Feast of St Dominic.', 0, NULL),
(4588, NULL, 'Carmelitan', 'Flos Carmeli', 1, 'se', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)Flos(d) Car(e)m\\u00e9(fe)li,(d) (,)\\r\\nvi(g)tis(f) flo(e)r\\u00ed(f)ge(e)ra,(d) (;)\\r\\nsplen(f)dor(g) c\\u00e6(hg)li,(f) (,)\\r\\nVir(h)go(g) pu(f)\\u00e9r(g)pe(g)ra(d) (;)\\r\\nsin(d)gu(e)l\\u00e1(fe)ris.(d) (::)\"', '2. Ma(h)ter(jvIH) mi(i)tis,(g) (,)\nsed(h) vi(j)ri(i) né(g)sci(i)a,(h) (;)\nCar(k)me(kvJH)lí(j)tis(i) (,)\ne(g)sto(i) pro(h)pí(j)ti(i)a,(h) (;)\nStel(h)la(hhd) ma(fe)ris.(d) (::)\n\n3. Ra(d)dix(e) Ies(fe)se(d) (,)\ngér(g)mi(f)nans(e) fló(f)scu(e)lum,(d) (;)\nnos(f) ad(g)és(hg)se(f) (,)\nte(h)cum(g) in(f) sæ(g)cu(g)lum(d) (;)\npa(d)ti(e)á(fe)ris.(d) (::)\n\n4. In(h)ter(jvIH) spi(i)nas(g) (,)\nquæ(h) cre(j)scis(i) lí(g)li(i)um,(h) (;)\nser(k)va(kvJH) pu(j)ras(i) (,)\nmen(g)tes(i) fra(h)gí(j)li(i)um,(h) (;)\ntu(h)te(hhd)lá(fe)ris!(d) (::)\n\n5. Ar(d)ma(e)tú(fe)ra(d) (,)\nfor(g)tis(f) pu(e)gnán(f)ti(e)um,(d) (;)\nfu(f)runt(g) bel(hg)la,(f) (,)\nten(h)de(g) præ(f)sí(g)di(g)um(d) (;)\nSca(d)pu(e)lá(fe)ris.(d) (::)\n\n6. Per(h) in(jvIH)cér(i)ta(g) (,)\npru(h)dens(j) con(i)sí(g)li(i)um,(h) (;)\nper(k) ad(kvJH)vér(j)sa(i) (,)\niu(g)ge(i) so(h)lá(j)ti(i)um(h) (;)\nlar(h)gi(hhd)á(fe)ris.(d) (::)\n\n7. Ma(d)ter(e) dul(fe)cis(d) (,)\nCar(g)mé(f)li(e) dó(f)mi(e)na,(d) (;)\nple(f)bem(g) tu(hg)am(f) (,)\nre(h)ple(g) læ(f)tí(g)ti(g)a(d) (;)\nqua(d) be(e)á(fe)ris.(d) (::)\n\n8. Pa(h)rá(jvIH)di(i)si(g) (,)\ncla(h)vis(j) et(i) iá(g)nu(i)a,(h) (;)\nfac(k) nos(kvJH) du(j)ci(i) (,)\nquo,(g) Ma(i)ter,(h) glo(j)ri(i)a(h) (;)\nco(h)ro(hhd)ná(fe)ris.(d) (::)\nA(ded)men.(cd) (,) Al(df)le(e)lú(d)ia.(d) (::)', NULL, '', 0, NULL),
(4589, NULL, 'Proprium Poloniae', 'Ego Mater', 1, 'an', '7', 'a', 'InNomine', '', NULL, '\"(c3)E(e)go(ehg) M\\u00e1(hi)ter(i\'_) *(,) p\\u00fal(i)chrae(g\') di(h)lec(i\')ti(h)\\u00f3(ij)nis,(i_\') (,) et(h) ti(jk)m\\u00f3(ji)ris,(i.) (;) et(j) ag(i)ni(h)ti(f)\\u00f3(h)nis(g_h) (,) et(i_f) s\\u00e1n(g)ctae(f) sp\\u00e9(e.)i.(e.) (::) E(i) u(i) o(j) u(i) a(h) e.(gf..) (::)  \"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(4590, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Mulieres sedentes', 1, 'an', '1', 'a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)\\r\\nMu(c)li(d)e(ixdh!iv)res(h) *(::) se(h)d\\u00e9n(h)tes(h) ad(h) mo(h)nu(h)m\\u00e9n(h)tum(hg/hiHG) (;) la(fg)men(h)ta(gf)b\\u00e1n(g)tur,(df) (;1) flen(g)tes(fe) D\\u00f3(d)mi(d)num.(d) (::) \"', NULL, NULL, 'Benedictus Antiphon, Holy Saturday', 0, NULL),
(4591, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Mulieres sedentes', 1, 'an', '1', 'a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)\\r\\nMu(c)li(d)e(ixdh!iv)res(h) *(::) se(h)d\\u00e9n(h)tes(h) ad(h) mo(h)nu(h)m\\u00e9n(h)tum(hg/hiHG ;) la(fg)men(h)ta(gf)b\\u00e1n(g)tur,(df ;1) flen(g)tes(fe) D\\u00f3(d)mi(d)num.(d ::) \"', NULL, NULL, 'Benedictus Antiphon, Holy Saturday', 0, NULL),
(4592, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Pie Pater', 1, 'an', '1', 'b', NULL, 'Ad II Vesperas. In Transl. et Com.', NULL, '\"(c4)\\r\\nPi(ixdh!iv)e(h ::) Pa(ghg)ter(fvED) Do(efe)m\\u00ed(d)ni(cd)ce,(d ;) tu(h)\\u00f3(jk)rum(kj) me(ivHG)mor(f) \\u00f3(g)per(gfg)um,(h :) sta(h) co(jij)ram(k) sum(jh/hg~)mo(f) J\\u00fa(ghg)di(fvED)ce(c ;) pro(c) tu(d)o(fg>) c\\u00e6(ed)tu(efe) p\\u00e1u(d)pe(cd)rum.(d ::) <i>T.P.</i> Al-(fg>)le(e/fvED/d)lu(cd~)ia(d ::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'In translatione et commemoratione', 0, NULL),
(4593, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Adest dies laetitiae', 1, 'an', '1', 'b', NULL, 'Ad II Vesperas', NULL, '\"(c4)\\r\\nA-(ixdh!iv)dest(h ::) di(ghg)es(fvED) l\\u00e6(efe)t\\u00ed(d)ti(cd)\\u00e6,(d ;) quo(h) be(jk)\\u00e1(kj)tus(ivHG) Do(f)m\\u00ed(g)ni(gfg)cus(h :) au(h)lam(jij) c\\u00e6(k) l\\u00e9(jh/hg~)stis(f) c\\u00fa(ghg)ri(fvED)\\u00e6(c ;) ci(c)vis(d)in(fg>)trat(ed) ma(efe)gn\\u00ed(d)fi(cd)cus.(d ::) <i>T.P.</i> Al-(fg>)le(e/fvED/d)lu(cd~)ia(d ::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(4594, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Ave Maris Stella', 1, 'hy', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)A(d)<sc>ve</sc>(h/hi ::) ma(g)ris(hi) ste(jk)lla,(jvIHG ;)\\r\\nDe(h)i(h) Ma(de)ter(g) al(fe)ma,(d :)\\r\\nAt(f)que(e) sem(g)per(h) Vir(h)go,(de/fvEDC ;)\\r\\nFe(e)lix(g) c\\u00e6(e)li(f) por(evDC)ta.(d ::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, 'Sumens illud Ave\nGabriélis ore,\nFunda nos in pace,\nMutans nomen Evæ.\n\nSolve vincla reis,\nProfer lumen cæcis:\nMala nostra pelle,\nBona cuncta posce.\n\nMonstra te esse Matrem;\nSumat per te preces, \nQui pro nobis natus\nTulit esse tuus.\n\nVirgo singuláris,\nInter omnes mitis,\nNos culpis solútos\nMites fac et castos.\n\nVitam præsta puram,\nIter para tutum:\nUt vidéntes Jesum,\nSemper collætémur.\n\nSit laus Deo Patri,\nSummo Christo decus,\nSpiritúi Sancto\nTribus honor unus. Amen.\n', 'Said by Blessed Jordan of Saxony to have been one of St Dominic\'s favourite hymns;  the other was Veni Creator Spiritus.', 0, NULL),
(4595, NULL, NULL, 'Fulget in choro Virginum', 1, 'an', '5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)\\r\\n ()Ful(fe/ed~)get(d ::) in(f) cho(h)ro(ih) V\\u00edr(ik)gi(jvIH)num(h ;) Doc(f)tor(gx/g) ve(fe)ri(d)t\\u00e1(e/fd)tis,(d :) ser(fv)tum(d) ho(f)n\\u00f3(h)ris(ih) g\\u00e9(f)mi(gxgh)num(h ;) ge(f/gh)rens(gvFE) cum(d) be(ef)\\u00e1(ded)tis.(d ::) <i> T.P. </i> Al(de)le(e)l\\u00fa(d)ia.(d ::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Fifth psalm antiphon at Lauds on St Dominic\'s Day.  Note that at this time Gregoria cannot generate the correct neume for the first note in \"sertum\" in Dominican chant.', 0, NULL),
(4596, NULL, 'Solesmes 1934', 'Si culmen', 1, 'an', '7', 'c', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)SI(ig/ij) cul(i_j)men(i\'_) *(,) ve(i)ri(i\') ho(g)n\\u00f3(hi)ris(g) qu\\u01fd(e)ri(e)tis,(e.) (;) ad(e) il(g)lam(g\') c\\u00e6(g)l\\u00e9(g\')stem(h) p\\u00e1(f\')tri(h)am(g\'_) (,) quan(f)t\\u00f3(e\')ci(f)us(f\'_) pro(h)pe(g)r\\u00e1(e.)te.(e.) (::)\\r\\nE(i) u(i) o(j) u(i) a(h) e.(gh..) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(4597, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Lauda Mater Ecclesia', 1, 'hy', '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(f3)\\r\\nLau(e)da(f) ma(fg)ter(e) Ec(f)cl\\u00e9(h)si(g)a,(f ::)\\r\\nLau(h)da(j) Chris(f)ti(h) cle(i)m\\u00e9n(hvGF)ti(e)am,(f :) \\r\\nQu\\u00e6(c) sep(e)tem(f) pur(fe)gat(fg) v\\u00ed(h)ti(gf)a (e ;)\\r\\nPer(g) s\\u00e9p(i)ti(j)for(h)mem(i) gr\\u00e1(hvGF)ti(e)am. (f :)\"', NULL, 'María, soror Lázari, :\nQuæ tot commísit crímina, \nAb ipsa fauce tártari \nRedit ad vitæ límina. \n\nPost fluxæ carnis scándala \nFit ex lebéte phíala \nIn vas transláta glóriæ\nDe vase contuméliæ. \n\nÆgra currit ad médicum \nVas ferens aromáticum \nEt a morbo multíplici \nVerbo curátur médici. \n\nSurgéntem cum victória \nIesum videt ab ínferis, \nPrima merétur gáudia, \nQuæ plus ardébat céteris. \n\nUni Deo sit glória \nPro multifórmi gratia, \nQui culpas et supplícia \nRemíttit et dat præmia. Amen. \n', NULL, 0, NULL),
(4598, NULL, 'Dominican', 'Haec est Regina', 1, 'an', '1', NULL, NULL, 'Super Ps. In festis B. Mariæ V.', NULL, '\"(f3)H\\u00e6c(ef) est(f ::) Re(gh)g\\u00ed(i)na(ig) V\\u00edr(hi)gin(hg)um, (g ;)qu\\u00e6(ef) g\\u00e9n(fe)u(h)it(ghg) Reg(f)em,(f :) vel(h!ij)ut(iji) ro(hg)sa(fe ,4) de(hih)c\\u00f3r(gf)a(ghg) Vir(f)go.(f :)  De(e)i(fh) G\\u00e9n(h)i(hg)trix,(fe ;) per(kx/hi/jk) quam(j) re(ji)p\\u00e9r(hg)i(hi)mus(i ,6) De(h)um(hg) et(fe) h\\u00f3m(gh)i(gf)nem,(f :) al(e)ma(fh) Vir(hih/hg~)go,(fe ;) in(kx/hi/jk)ter(j)c\\u00e9d(ij)e(hgi ;) pro(iji) no(hg)bis(fe) \\u00f3m(gh)ni(gf)bus.(f ::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
