(4664, NULL, 'Vatican', 'Ecce veniet Propheta magnus', 1, 'an', '4', 'A*', 'Andrew Hinkley', NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)Ec(e)ce(f) v\\u00e9(h)ni(hi)et(i) <v>\\\\gresixstar</v>(,) Pro(hi)ph\\u00e9(j)ta(ih) ma(i)gnus,(i) (;) et(i) i(f)pse(i) re(g)no(h)v\\u00e1(fe)bit(f) (,) Je(e)r\\u00fa(d)sa(e)lem,(gxfg) al(h)le(h)l\\u00fa(f)ja.(f) (::) E(i) u(h) o(i) u(j) a(h) e.(f) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(4665, NULL, 'Vatican', 'En clara vox', 1, 'hy', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)En(e) cla(c)ra(e) vox(g) red(h)\\u00e1r(i)gu(h)it(h) (,) Obs(g)c\\u00fa(h)ra(i) q{u\\u00e6}(j)q{ue},(ig) p\\u00e9r(h)so(i)nans:(h) (;) Pro(h)cul(h) fu(i)g\\u00e9n(g)tur(eg) s\\u00f3m(f)ni(e)a,(d ) ( ,) Ab(e) al(c)to(e) Je(g)sus(h) pr\\u00f3(i)mi(h)cat.(h) {<i>I</i>}<i>n fine.</i>(::) A(hih)men.(gh) (::)\"', NULL, 'Mens jam resúrgat tórpida,\nNon ámplius jacens humi:\nSidus refúlget jam novum,\nUt tollat omne nóxium.\n\nEn Agnus ad nos míttitur\nLaxáre gratis débitum:\nOmnes simul cum lácrimis\nPrecémur indulgéntiam.\n\nUt cum secúndo fúlserit,\nMetúque mundum cínxerit,\nNon pro reátu púniat,\nSed nos pius tunc prótegat.\n\nVírtus, hónor, laus, glória\nDéo Pátri cum Fílio,\nSáncto simul Paráclito,\nIn sæculórum sǽcula. Amen.', 'Improved accentuation of text sourced from 1961 Liber Usualis.', 0, NULL),
(4666, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Iubilemus Deo', 1, 'an', '6', NULL, NULL, 'Ps 94, 1', NULL, '\"(c4) IU(f)bi(f)l\\u00e9(-fg)mus(f) De(f!gwh)o(-ghg) (,) sa(f)lu(gh)t\\u00e1(gvFD)ri(fg) nos(g)tro.(f) (::) \"', NULL, NULL, 'Ad invitatorium - feria secunda', 0, NULL),
