(7338, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Ps. 22 Dominus Pascit me', 0, 'ps', '8', NULL, 'Fernando Gil', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)1.() D\\u00f3(g)mi(hg)nus(gj) pa(j)scit(j) me,(j) et(j) ni(j)<i>hil</i>(ji) <i>mi</i>(jk)<i>hi</i>(k) <b>d\\u00e9</b>(jk)e(jr)rit :(j.) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>(:) in(jh) p\\u00e1(hj)scu(j)is(j) vi(j)r\\u00e9n(j)ti(j)bus(j) me(j/ji) col(gh)lo(ji)c\\u00e1(h)vit.(g.) (::)\"', NULL, '\\item 2. Super aquas qui{\\it é}{\\it tis} {\\it e}{\\textbf{dú}xit me,~* ánimam meam refécit.\n\\item 3. Dedúxit me super sé{\\it mi}{\\it tas} {\\it iu}{\\textbf{stí}tiæ~* propter nomen suum.\n\\item 4. Nam et si ambulávero in valle umbræ mortis, non {\\it ti}{\\it mé}{\\it bo} {\\textbf{ma}la,~* quóniam tu mecum es.\n\\item 5. Virga tua et {\\it bá}{\\it cu}{\\it lus} {\\textbf{tu}us,~* ipsa me consoláta sunt.\n\\item 6. Parásti in conspé{\\it ctu} {\\it me}{\\it o} {\\textbf{men}sam~* advérsus eos, qui tríbulant me.\n\\item 7. impinguásti in óle{\\it o} {\\it ca}{\\it put} {\\textbf{me}um,~* et calix meus redúndat.\n\\item 8. Etenim benígnitas et misericórdi{\\it a} {\\it subs}{\\it e}{\\textbf{quén}tur me~* ómnibus diébus vitæ meæ.', 'for use with the communion antiphon ad Missam vespertinam in cena Domini (GR 1974) Nova vulgata psalm.', 0, NULL),
