(7352, NULL, NULL, 'Ps. 117 Confitemini Domino (Dominica Resurrectionis)', 0, 'ps', NULL, NULL, 'Fernando Gil', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)1.() Con(fg)fi(gf)t\\u00e9(gh)mi(h)ni(h) D\\u00f3(h)mi(h)<i>no</i>,(g) <b>qu\\u00f3</b>(ixi)ni(hr)am(h) <b>bo</b>(g fr)nus,(f.) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>(:) qu\\u00f3(f)ni(gh)am(hj) in(g) s<sp>\'ae</sp>(f)cu(f)lum(f) mi(f)se(f)ri(f)<i>c\\u00f3r</i>(g)<i>di</i>(fd)<i>a</i>(f) <b>e</b>(g fr)ius.(f.) (::) Pas(f)cha...(fhgh) (::)\"', NULL, '\\item 2 Dicat nunc Is{\\it rael}, {\\textbf{quó}niam {\\textbf{bo}nus,~* quóniam in sǽculum miseri{\\it cór}{\\it di}{\\it a} {\\textbf{e}ius. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 3 De tribulatióne in{\\it vo}{\\textbf{cá}vi {\\textbf{Dó}minum,~* et exaudívit me edúcens in lati{\\it tú}{\\it di}{\\it nem} {\\textbf{Dó}minus. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 4 Bonum est confú{\\it ge}{\\textbf{re} ad {\\textbf{Dó}minum~* quam confí{\\it de}{\\it re} {\\it in} {\\textbf{hó}mine. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 5 Omnes gen{\\it tes} {\\textbf{cir}cu{\\textbf{ié}runt me,~* et in nómine Dómini {\\it ex}{\\it cí}{\\it di} {\\textbf{e}os. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 6 Circumdántes {\\it cir}{\\textbf{cum}de{\\textbf{dé}runt me,~* et in nómine Dómini {\\it ex}{\\it cí}{\\it di} {\\textbf{e}os. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 7 Impelléntes impulé{\\it runt} {\\textbf{me}, ut {\\textbf{cá}derem,~* et Dó{\\it mi}{\\it nus} {\\it ad}{\\textbf{iú}vit me. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 8 Fortitúdo mea et {\\it laus} {\\textbf{me}a {\\textbf{Dó}minus~* et factus est mi{\\it hi} {\\it in} {\\it sa}{\\textbf{lú}tem. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 9 Vox iubilatiónis et salútis in taberná{\\it cu}{\\textbf{lis} iu{\\textbf{stó}rum~:~* Déxtera Dómini {\\it fe}{\\it cit} {\\it vir}{\\textbf{tú}tem! \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 10 Déxtera Dómini exaltáta {\\it est}~; {\\textbf{déx}tera {\\textbf{Dó}mini~* Déxtera Dómini {\\it fe}{\\it cit} {\\it vir}{\\textbf{tú}tem! \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 11 Non mó{\\it ri}{\\textbf{ar}, sed {\\textbf{vi}vam~* et narrábo {\\it ó}{\\it pe}{\\it ra} {\\textbf{Dó}mini. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 12 Confitébor tibi, quóni{\\it am} {\\textbf{ex}au{\\textbf{dí}sti me~* et factus es mi{\\it hi} {\\it in} {\\it sa}{\\textbf{lú}tem. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 13 Lápidem quem reprobavérunt {\\it æ}{\\textbf{di}fi{\\textbf{cán}tes,~* hic factus est {\\it in} {\\it ca}{\\it put} {\\textbf{án}guli~; \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 14 A Dómi{\\it no} {\\textbf{fa}ctum est {\\textbf{i}stud~* et est mirábile in {\\it ó}{\\it cu}{\\it lis} {\\textbf{no}stris. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 15 Hæc est dies, {\\it quam} {\\textbf{fe}cit {\\textbf{Dó}minus~:~* exsultémus et læ{\\it té}{\\it mur} {\\it in} {\\textbf{e}a. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 16 O Dómi{\\it ne}, {\\textbf{sal}vum {\\textbf{me} fac~;~* o Dómine, da {\\it pro}{\\it spe}{\\it ri}{\\textbf{tá}tem! \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 17 Benedíctus, qui venit {\\it in} {\\textbf{nó}mine {\\textbf{Dó}mini.~* Benedícimus vobis {\\it de} {\\it do}{\\it mo} {\\textbf{Dó}mini. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 18 Deus meus es tu, et con{\\it fi}{\\textbf{té}bor {\\textbf{ti}bi,~* Deus meus, {\\it et} {\\it ex}{\\it al}{\\textbf{tá}bo te. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.\n\\item 19 Confitémini Dómi{\\it no}, {\\textbf{quó}niam {\\textbf{bo}nus,~* quóniam in sǽculum miseri{\\it cór}{\\it di}{\\it a} {\\textbf{e}ius. \\textit{Ant.}  Pascha.', 'use with the Communion Ant.: Pascha nostrum for Dominica in Resurrectionis. (GR 1974, p. 199) Nova Vulgata text', 0, NULL),
