(7362, NULL, NULL, 'Ps. 67 Exsurgit Deus ()', 0, 'ps', '7', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)1.() Ex(ehg)s\\u00far(hi)git(i) De(i)us,(i) et(i) dis(i)si(i)p\\u00e1n(i)tur(i) in(i)i(i)<b>m\\u00ed</b>(ik jr)ci(j jr[ocba:1;6mm]) <b>e</b>(ji)ius ;(ij..) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>(:) et(ig) f\\u00fa(hi)gi(i)unt,(i) qui(i) o(i)d\\u00e9(i)runt(i) e(i)um,(i) a(i) f\\u00e1(i!jwk)ci(i)e(h) e(hhh)ius.(fe..) (::) Fa(e)ctus(ei) est...(i) (::)\\r\\n<i>Flexa :</i>()  vir(i)t\\u00fa(i)tem \\u2020(h. i i i  ::)\"', NULL, '\\item 2 Et iusti læténtur et exsúltent in con{\\textbf{spé}ctu {\\textbf{De}i~* et delecténtur in lætítia. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 3 Cantáte Deo, psalmum dícite {\\textbf{nó}mini {\\textbf{e}ius~;~* iter fácite ei, qui fertur super nubes~: Dóminus nomen illi. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 4 Iubiláte in conspéctu eius~; pater orphanórum et iudex {\\textbf{vi}du{\\textbf{á}rum,~* Deus in habitáculo sancto suo. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 5 Deus, cum egrederéris in conspéctu {\\textbf{pó}puli {\\textbf{tu}i,~* cum pertransíres in desérto. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 6 Terra mota est, étiam cæli di{\\textbf{stil}la{\\textbf{vé}runt~* a fácie Dei Sínai, a fácie Dei Israël. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 7 Benedíctus Dóminus {\\textbf{di}e quo{\\textbf{tí}{\\textbf{di}e~;~* portábit nos Deus salutárium nostrórum. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 8 Deus noster, Deus {\\textbf{ad} sal{\\textbf{ván}dum~;~* et Dómini, Dómini éxitus mortis. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 9 Manda, Deus, vir{\\textbf{tú}ti {\\textbf{tu}æ~;~* confírma hoc, Deus, quod operátus es in nobis. \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.\n\\item 10 Mirábilis, Deus, de sanctuário tuo! Deus Israël ipse tríbuet virtútem~† et fortitúdinem plebi suæ. Bene{\\textbf{dí}ctus {\\textbf{De}us! \\textit{Ant.}  Factus est.', 'for use with the Co. Antiphon \"Factus Est\" in die Pentecostes according with the 1974 Graduale. Nova Vulgata Text', 0, NULL),
