(h) (;) Mi(i)hi(k) tol(j)li(ih) non(i) pó(gh)te(i)ris,(h) (:) Cum(e) me(gh)um(h) cor(hg) ab(ede)sú(f)le(e)ris,(d) (;) Je(h)su,(d) laus(e) no(g)stri(fe) gé(d)ne(e)ris.(e) (::)\n\n37.() Por(e)tas(gh) ve(h)stras(hg) at(h)tól(j)li(i)te,(h) (;) Cœ(i)li(k) ci(j)ves(ih) oc(i)cú(gh)ri(i)te,(h) (:) Tri(e)um(gh)pha(h)tó(hg)ri(ede) dí(f)ci(e)te:(d) (;) Sal(h)ve,(d) Je(e)su(g) Chri(fe)st<i>e</i>(d) ín(d)cli(e)te.(e) (::)\n\n38.() Rex(e) vir(gh)tú(h)tum,(hg) Rex(h) gló(j)ri(i)æ,(h) (;) Rex(i) in(k)sí(j)gnis(ih) vi(i)ctó(gh)ri(i)æ,(h) (:) Je(e)su,(gh) lar(h)gí(hg)tor(ede) grá(f)ti(e)æ,(d) (;) Ho(h)nor(d) cœ(e)lé(g)stis(fe) cú(d)ri(e)æ.(e) (::)\n\n39.() Te(e) cœ(gh)li(h) cho(hg)rus(h) præ(j)di(i)cat,(h) (;) Et(i) tu(k)as(j) lau(ih)des(i) ré(gh)pli(i)cat;(h) (:) Je(e)sus(gh) or(h)bem(hg) læ(ede)tí(f)fi(e)cat(d) (;) Et(h) nos(d) De(e)o(g) pa(fe)cí(d)fi(e)cat.(e) (::)\n\n40.() Je(e)sus(gh) in(h) pa(hg)ce(h) im(j)pe(i)rat,(h) (;) Qui(i) om(k)nem(j) sen(ih)sum(i) sú(gh)pe(i)rat;(h) (:) Hunc(e) sem(gh)per(h) mens(hg) de(ede)sí(f)de(e)rat(d) (;) Et(h) il(d)lo(e) fru(g)i(fe) pró(d)pe(e)rat.(e) (::)\n\n41.()  Je(e)sus(gh) ad(h) Pa(hg)trem(h) ré(j)di(i)it,(h) (;) Re(i)gnum(k) cœ(j)lé(ih)ste(i) sú(gh)bi(i)it,(h) (:) Cor(e) me(gh)um(h) a(hg) me(ede) trán(f)si(e)it,(d) (;) Post(h) e(d)um(e) si(g)mul(fe) á(d)bi(e)it.(e) (::)', '\\noindent\n\\begin{tabular}{@{}ll}\n\\hspace*{3mm}Nil cánitur suávius, & ﻿\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, dulcédo córdium,\\\\\nNil audítur jucúndius, & Fons veri, lumen méntium,\\\\\nNil cogitátur dúlcius, & Excédit omne gáudium\\\\\nQuam Jesus Dei Filius. & Et omne desidérium.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, spes pœniténtibus, & \\hspace*{3mm}Nec lingua potest dícere\\\\\nQuam dulcis es peténtibus, & Nec líttera exprímere,\\\\\nQuam bonus te quæréntibus, & Expértus potest crédere\\\\\nSed quam inveniéntibus! & Quid sit Jesum dilígere.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesum quaeram in léctulo, & \\hspace*{3mm}Qui te gustant esúriunt.\\\\\nClauso cordis cubiculo, & Qui bibunt, adhuc sítiunt,\\\\\nPrivátim et in público & Desideráre nésciunt\\\\\nQuæram amóre sédulo. & Nisi Jesum quem díligunt.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Cum Maria dilúculo & \\hspace*{3mm}Quem tuus amor ébriat\\\\\nJesum quæram in tumulo, & Novit quid Jesus sápiat;\\\\\nCordis clamóre quærulo, & Non est quid ultra cúpiat,\\\\\nMente quæram, non óculo. & Felix gustus quem sátiat.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Turbam profúndam flétibus, & \\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, decus angélicum,\\\\\nLocum replens gemítibus, & In aure dulce cánticum,\\\\\nJesum provólvar pédibus, & In ore mei miríficum,\\\\\nStrictis hærens ampléxibus. & Corde pigméntum cœlicum.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu stringam vestígia, & \\hspace*{3mm}Desídero te míllies,\\\\\nEt flendo figam lábia, & Mi Jesu, quando vénies,\\\\\nUt detur mihi vénia, & Quam me lætum fácies,\\\\\nAtque proféctus grátia. & Tuo vultu me sáties.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, Rex admirábilis, & \\hspace*{3mm}Amor tuus est óptimus,\\\\\nEt triumphátor nóbilis, & Mihi languor assíduus,\\\\\nDulcédo ineffábilis, & Mihi Jesu mellífluus,\\\\\nEt totus desiderábilis. & Fructus vitæ perpétuus.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Mane nobíscum, Dómine, & \\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, summa benígnitas,\\\\\nMane novo cum lúmine, & Mira cordis jucúnditas,\\\\\nPulsa noctis calígine, & Incomprehénsa bónitas,\\\\\nMundum replens dulcédine. & Tua me stringit cháritas.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Amor Jesu dulcíssimus, & \\hspace*{3mm}Bonum mihi dilígere\\\\\nEt vere suavíssimus, & Jesum, nil ultra quærere,\\\\\nPlus míllies gratíssimus & Mihi prorsus et dícere\\\\\nQuam dícerc suffícimus. & Ut illi queam vivere.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Expérti recognóscite, & \\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, mihi dulcíssime,\\\\\nAmórem pium póscite, & Spes suspirántis animæ,\\\\\nJesum ardénter quærite, & Te quærent piæ lácrymæ,\\\\\nQuaeréndo inardéscite. & Et clamor mentis íntimæ.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesus, auctor cleméntiæ, & \\hspace*{3mm}Quocúmque loco fúero\\\\\nTotíus spes lætítia, & Mecum Jesum desídero;\\\\\nDulcóris fons et grátiæ, & Quam lætus cum invénero,\\\\\nVeræ cordis lætítiae. & Quam felix cum tenúero;\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Cum digne loqui néqueam, & \\hspace*{3mm}Tunc ampléxus, tunc óscula\\\\\nDe te tamen non síleam, & Quæ vincunt mellis pócula,\\\\\nAmor facit ut árdeam & Tunc felix Christi cópula,\\\\\nLoqui cum de te gáudeam. & Sed in his parva mórula.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Tua, Jesu, diléctio, & \\hspace*{3mm}Quem concupívi téneo,\\\\\nGrata mentis reféctio, & Jam quem quæsívi vídeo,\\\\\nReplet sine fastídio, & Amóre Jesu lángueo\\\\\nDans famem desidério. & Et corde totus árdeo.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Hic amor missus cœlitus & \\hspace*{3mm}Dilécte mi, revértere\\\\\nHæret mihi medúllitus, & Consors patérnæ déxteræ,\\\\\nMentem incéndit pénitus, & Hostem vicísti próspere,\\\\\nHoc delectátur spíritus. & Jam cœli regno frúere.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}O beátum incéndium! & \\hspace*{3mm}Sequor quocúmque íeris,\\\\\nO ardens desidérium! & Mihi tolli non póteris,\\\\\nO dulce refrigérium! & Cum meum cor abstúleris,\\\\\nAmáre Dei Fílium! & Jesu, laus nostri géneris.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesus cum sic dilígitur, & \\hspace*{3mm}Portas vestras attóllite,\\\\\nHic amor non extínguitur, & Cœli cives occúrrite,\\\\\nNec tepéscit, nec móritur, & Triumphatóri dícite:\\\\\nPlus crescit et accénditur. & Salve, Jesu Christ{\\it{e}} ínclite.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, flos Matris vírginis, & \\hspace*{3mm}Rex virtútum, Rex glóriæ,\\\\\nArdor nostræ dulcédinis, & Rex insígnis victóriæ,\\\\\nLaus honórque Núminis, & Jesu, largítor grátiæ,\\\\\nRexque beatitúdinis. & Honor cœléstis cúriæ.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Jesu, sole serénior, & \\hspace*{3mm}Te cœli chorus prædicat,\\\\\nEt balsámo suávior, & Et tuas laudes réplicat;\\\\\nOmni dulcóre dúlcior, & Jesus orbem lætíficat\\\\\nPræ cunctis amabílior. & Et nos Deo pacíficat.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Cujus amor sic áfficit, & \\hspace*{3mm}Jesus in pace ímperat,\\\\\nCujus gustus me réficit, & Qui omnem sensum súperat;\\\\\nJesus, in quem mens déficit & Hunc semper mens desíderat\\\\\nSolus amánti súfficit. & Et ilio frui próperat.\\\\\n\\hspace*{3mm}Tu, mentis delectátio, & \\hspace*{3mm}Jesus ad Patrem rédiit,\\\\\nAmóris consummátio, & Regnum cœléste súbiit,\\\\\nTu, mea gloriátio, & Cor meum a me tránsiit,\\\\\nJesu, mundi salvátio. & Post eum simul ábiit.\n\\end{tabular}', '', 0, NULL),
