(8237, '', 'Simplex', 'Psalmus 24', 0, 'ps', '4', 'c', 'Mateusz Ciesiółka', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)<sp>V/</sp>. 1<alt>Cantor</alt> <i>Ne</i>(i)<i>que</i>(hi) ex(i)s\\u00fal(i)tent(i) su(i)per(i) me(i) i(i)ni(i)<i>mi</i>(h)<i>ci</i>(i) <b>me</b>-(jr1)(ir)i,(i) *(:) \\u00e9t(i) e(i)nim(i) u(i)ni(i)v\\u00e9r(i)si(i) qui(i) s\\u00fas(i)ti(i)nent(i) te(i) non(i) con(i)fun(i)<b>d\\u00e9n</b>-(ir1)(hr)tur.(h) (::)\\r\\nAnt. {A}d<alt>Omnes</alt>(f) te,(h) D\\u00f3(hi)mi(i)ne.(i) (::) Flexa: {e}t(i) <b>do</b>(ir1)ce(h) me,(h) \\u2020(,) (i) (i) (::)\"', '', 'Intonatio rursus fieri debet initio cuiusque versiculi.\\\\\n\\\\\n2. {\\it Vias} tuas, Dómine, de{\\it mónstra} {\\bf mi}hi, * et sémitas tuas édo{\\bf ce} me. Ant. Ad te, Dómine.\\\\\n\\\\\n3. {\\it Díri}ge me in veritáte tua, et {\\bf do}ce me, + quia tu es Deus sa{\\it lútis} {\\bf me}ae, * et te sustínui tota {\\bf di}e. Ant. Ad te, Dómine.\\\\\n\\\\\n4. {\\it Secún}dum misericórdiam tuan me{\\it ménto} {\\bf me}i tu, * propter bonitátem tuam, {\\bf Dó}mine. Ant. Ad te, Dómine.\\\\\n\\\\\n5. {\\it Dulcis} et {\\it rectus} {\\bf Dó}minus, * propter hoc peccatóres viam do{\\bf cé}bit. Ant. Ad te, Dómine.\\\\\n\\\\\n6. {\\it Díri}get manuétos {\\it in iu}{\\bf dí}cio, * docébit mites vias {\\bf su}as. Ant. Ad te, Dómine.\\\\', 'Missa I Tempus Adventus', 0, NULL),
