(9740, NULL, 'Solesmes 1934', 'In sanctitate et justitia servierunt', 1, 'an', '8', 'a', 'Dominique CROCHU', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)IN(j) sanc(i)ti(g)t\\u00e1(i_j)te(h\') *() et(h) jus(gf)t\\u00ed(gh)ti(h)a(g.) (,) ser(i)vi(j)\\u00e9(k)runt(jh) D\\u00f3(j)mi(j)no(i.) (;) \\u00f3m(k)ni(j)bus(ji) di(h)\\u00e9(j_h)bus(i_h) su(g.)is:(g.) (:) \\u00edd(f)e(fg)o(g\'_) sto(g)lam(ge) gl\\u00f3(f)ri(e)\\u00e6(d\') \\u00ednd(f)u(e)it(f) il(gh)los(g\'_) (,) D\\u00f3(h)mi(g)nus,(f\') De(g)us(h) Is(hji)ra(h)el.(g.) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Antiphona ex officio SS Cyrilli et Methodii, modo Antiphonale Monasticum 1934 restituta.', 0, NULL),
(9741, NULL, 'Antiphonale Solesmense 1935', 'Isti sunt duae olivae', 1, 'an', '1', 'd', 'Dominique CROCHU', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)IS(cf)ti(fe) sunt(d\'_) *() du(e)\\u00e6(dc) o(cd)l\\u00ed(de)v\\u00e6,(d\'_) (,) et(d) du(fe)o(fg) can(fe~)de(de)l\\u00e1(dd)bra(c.) (;) lu(e)c\\u00e9n(ed~)ti(cd)a(d) an(e_0fg~)te(gvFE\') D\\u00f3(d)mi(cd)num:(d.) (:) ha(dh\'!iv)bent(h) pot(hg)es(gf)t\\u00e1(ghg\')tem(h_/iih.) (,) cl\\u00e1u(h>)de(j)re(jk) c\\u00e6(ji)lum(hg~) n\\u00fa(h)bi(ij)bus,(h.) (;) et(h_ggo) a(e)pe(f\')r\\u00ed(g)re(g_e) por(gh)tas(fe) e(d!ewf_e)jus(dc..) (;) qui(e)a(ed) lin(cd~)gu\\u00e6(d\') e(d)\\u00f3(e_f)rum(ghg/hiHGgo) (,) cla(e\')ves(f) c\\u00e6(g)li(fe) fac(d)t\\u00e6(cd) sunt.(d.) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Require apud Antiphonalem Monasticum 1935, p. 1203', 0, NULL),
(9742, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Jam lucis orto (Festis Sermonis, et MM. maj.))', 1, 'hy', '1', NULL, 'Abbaye de Rieunette', 'In omnibus Festis Sermonis, et MM. maj.', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{J}</v>am(c4d) lu(d)cis(f) or(d)to(c) s\\u00ed(f)de(gh)re,(h) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v>(,)\\r\\nDe(hg)um(j) pre(jk)c\\u00e9(ji)mur(h) s\\u00fap(h)pli(g)ces(h) (;)\\r\\nut(dh) in(h) di(ixhih)\\u00far(g)nis(ge) \\u00e1c(f)ti(ed)bus(de) (,)\\r\\nnos(c) ser(e)vet(g) a(ghg) no(fe)c\\u00e9n(d)ti(cd)bus.(d) (::)\"', NULL, 'Linguam refraenans témperet,\\\\\nNe litis horror ínsonet:\\\\\nVisum fovéndo cóntegat,\\\\\nNe vanitátes háuriat.\\\\\n\nSint pura cordis íntima,\\\\\nAbsístat et vécordia,\\\\\nCarnis terat supérbiam\\\\\nPotus cibíque párcitas.\\\\\n\nUt cum dies abscésserit,\\\\\nNoctémque sors redúxerit,\\\\\nMundi per abstinéntiam\\\\\nIpsi canámus glóriam.\\\\\n\nDeo Patri sit glória,\\\\\nEjúsque soli Fílio,\\\\\nCum Spíritu Paráclito,\\\\\nEt nunc, et in perpétuum. Amen.', 'Hymnarium cisterciense, Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Lichtenthal 28 (1250) folio 3r', 0, NULL),
(9743, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Christe qui lux', 1, 'hy', '2', NULL, NULL, 'Ad completorium in dominicis', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{C}</v>hris(f3f)te,(fh) qui(fe) lux(f) es(g) et(h) di(f)es,(f) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v>(,)\\r\\nnoc(f)tis(f) te(h)n\\u00e9(g)bras(e) d\\u00e9(f)te(h)gis,(g) (;) lu(h)c\\u00eds(i)que(h) lu(g)men(f) cr\\u00e9(h)de(f)ris,(f) (,) lu(g)men(g) be(fe)\\u00e1(f)tis(g) pr\\u01fd(h)di(f)cans.(f) (::) \"', 'Precámur, sancte Dómine,\ndefénde nos in hac nocte;\nsit nobis in te réquies,\nquiétam noctem tríbue.\n\nNe gravis somnus írruat,\nnec hostis nos subrípiat,\nne car<i>o</i> illi conséntiens, \nnos tibi reos státuat.\n\nOculi somno cápiant,\ncor semper ad te vígilet;\ndéxtera tua prótegas\nfámulos, qui te díligunt.\n\nDefénsor noster, áspice,\ninsidiántes réprime,\ngubérna tuos fámulos,\nquos sánguine mercátus es.\n\nMeménto nostri, Dómine, \nin gravi isto córpore\nqui es defénsor ánimæ, \nadésto nobis, Dómine.\n\nPræsta, Pater piíssime,\nPatríque compar Unice,\ncum Spíritu Paráclito,\nregnans per omne sǽculum. Amen.\n', NULL, 'Hymnarium cisterciense, Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Lichtenthal 28 (1250) folio 6r', 0, NULL),
(9744, NULL, 'Solesmes 1934', 'Me etenim', 1, 'an', '2', 'D', 'Br Michael', NULL, NULL, '\"((f3)Me(f.dewf) \\u00e9(fg)te(fg)nim(f\'_) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() de(f) di(h\')e(g) in(f) di(h\')em(g) qu\\u00e6(fg_)runt,(ffe.) (;) et(hi_) sci(jk_)re(hi_) vi(hg)as(fe) me(f)as(hg) vo(f.)lunt.(f.) (::) E(h) u(h) o(h) u(g) a(ef) e.(f.::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
