(9809, NULL, 'Solesmes 1961', 'Divinum auxilium', 0, 'or', NULL, NULL, 'Fr. Drew Royals', 'This verse is said recto tono in a low voice', NULL, '\"(c3) <sp>V/</sp>. Di(e)v\\u00ed(e)num(e) au(e)x\\u00ed(e)li(e)um(e)  <v>\\\\grecross</v>() m\\u00e1(e)ne(e)at(e) sem(e)per(e) no(e)b\\u00eds(e)cum.(e) (::) (Z-)\\r\\n<sp>R/</sp>. A(e.)men.(e.) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(9810, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Amore Christi nobilis', 1, 'hy', '2', NULL, 'Abbaye de Rieunette', '27 dec. St John', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{A}</v>(c4h)m\\u00f3(hhg)re(ed) Chris(g)ti(hj) n\\u00f3(ji)bi(hi)lis(i) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v> (,) \\r\\net(k) f\\u00ed(k)li(i)us(j) To(h)n\\u00ed(ih)tru(gh)i,(h) (;) \\r\\nar(k)c\\u00e1(k)na(i) Io(k)\\u00e1n(klk)nes(j) De(ih)i,(g) (,) \\r\\nfa(i)tu(jk) re(i)ve(ji)l\\u00e1(h)vit(ih) sa(gh)cro.(h) (::)\"', 'Captis solébat píscibus\npatris senéctam páscere,\nturbánte, dum natat salo,\nimmóbilis fide stetit.\n\nHamum profúndo mérserat,\npiscátus est Verbum Dei :\niactávit undis rétia,\nvitam levávit hóminum.\n\nPiscis bonus pi<i>a</i> est Fides\nmundi supernátans salum,\nsubníxa Christi péctore,\nSancto locúta Spíritu :\n\n« In princíp<i>i</i>o erat Verbum,\net Verb<i>um</i> erat apud Deum,\net Deus erat Verb<i>um.</i> Hoc erat\nin princíp<i>i</i>o apud Deum.\n\nOmnia per ipsum facta sunt. »\nSed ipse laude résonet\net laureátus Spíritu\nscriptis coronétur suis.\n\nCommúne multis pássio,\ncruórque delíctum lavans;\nhoc morte præstat mártyrm,\nquod fecit esse mártyres.\n\nVinctus tamen ab ímpiis,\ncalént<i>e</i> olívo dícitur\ntersísse mundo púlverem,\nstetísse victor ǽmuli.\n\nGlória tibi, Dómine,\nglória Unigénito,\nuna cum Sancto Spíritu\nin sempitérna sǽcula. Amen.\n', NULL, 'Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Hymnarium cisterciense Lichtenthal 28, folio 31r', 0, NULL),
