(9863, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Iesu corona virginum', 1, 'hy', '8', NULL, 'Valley of Our Lady monastery', 'Commune virginum', NULL, '\"(c4)<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{I}</v>e(ggf)su,(g) co(hjji)r\\u00f3(jkkj)na(hg) v\\u00edr(f)gi(fg)num,(g) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v> (,) quem(j) Ma(jh)ter(ij) il(j)la(g) c\\u00f3n(hg)ci(fg)pit(g) (;) qu\\u00e6(j) so(k)la(l) vir(k)go(j) p\\u00e1r(k)tu(ji)rit,(hg) (,) h\\u00e6c(gh) vo(hg)ta(fd) cle(f)mens(gh) \\u00e1c(hg)ci(fg)pe.(g)  (::)\\r\\n (Z)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{Q}</v>ui(ggf) pa(g)scis(hjji) in(jkkj)ter(hg) l\\u00ed(f)li(fg)a(g) (,) s\\u00e6p(j)tus(jh) cho(ij)r\\u00e9(j)is(g) v\\u00edr(hg)gi(fg)num,(g) (;) spon(j)sus(k) de(l)c\\u00f3(k)rus(j) gl\\u00f3(k)ri(ji)a(hg) (,) spon(gh)s\\u00eds(hg)que(fd) red(f)dens(gh) pr\\u01fd(hg)mi(fg)a.(g)  (::)\\r\\n (Z)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{Q}</v>uo(ggf)c\\u00fam(g)que(hjji) per(jkkj)gis,(hg) v\\u00edr(f)gi(fg)nes(g) (,) se(j)qu\\u00fan(jh)tur,(ij) at(j)que(g) l\\u00e1u(hg)di(fg)bus(g) (;) post(j) te(k) ca(l)n\\u00e9n(k)tes(j) c\\u00far(k)si(ji)tant(hg) (,) hym(gh)n\\u00f3s(hg)que(fd) dul(f)ces(gh) p\\u00e9r(hg)so(fg)nant.(g)  (::)\\r\\n (Z)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{T}</v>e(ggf) de(g)pre(hjji)c\\u00e1(jkkj)mur,(hg) l\\u00e1r(f)gi(fg)us(g) (,) nos(j)tris(jh) ad(ij)\\u00e1u(j)ge(g) m\\u00e9n(hg)ti(fg)bus(g) (;) ne(j)sc\\u00ed(k)re(l) pror(k)sus(j) \\u00f3m(k)ni(ji)a(hg) (,) cor(gh)rup(hg)ti(fd)\\u00f3(f)nis(gh) v\\u00fal(hg)ne(fg)ra.(g)  (::) (Z)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{G}</v>l\\u00f3(ggf)ri(g)a(hjji) ti(jkkj)bi,(hg) D\\u00f3(f)mi(fg)ne,(g) (,) gl\\u00f3(j)ri(jh)a(ij) U(j)ni(g)g\\u00e9(hg)ni(fg)te,(g) (;) u(j)na(k) cum(l) Sanc(k)to(j) Sp\\u00ed(k)ri(ji)tu,(hg) (,) in(gh) sem(hg)pi(fd)t\\u00e9r(f)na(gh) s\\u01fd(hg)cu(fg)la.(g)  (::)\\r\\n A(ghg)men.(fg) (::)(Z) \\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Hymnarium cisterciense - Lichtenthal 28, folio 52r', 0, NULL),
(9864, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Iesu corona celsior', 1, 'hy', '1', NULL, 'Kloster Helfta', 'Commune confessorum', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{I}</v>e(c4c)su,(d) co(eg)r\\u00f3(gf)na(ed) c\\u00e9l(f)si(e)or,(d) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v>(,) \\r\\net(ce) v\\u00e9(g)ri(gh)tas(h) sub(g)l\\u00ed(hj)mi(ivHG)or,(h) (;)\\r\\nqui(hi) con(g)fi(gf)t\\u00e9n(e)ti(dc) s\\u00e9r(d)vu(de)lo(e)  (,) \\r\\nred(c)dis(d) per(eg)\\u00e9n(gf)ne(ed) pr\\u01fd(f)mi(e)um.(d) (::) \"', 'Da supplicánti cœtui, \nobténtu huius óptimi  \nremissiónem críminum \nrumpéndo nexum vínculi.\n\nAnni recúrso témpore,\ndies relúxit lúmine,\nquo Sanctus hic de córpore\npolum migrávit præpotens.\n\nHic vana terræ gáudia,\net luculénta prædia,\npollúta sorde députans,\novans tenet cæléstia.\n\nTe, Christe Rex piíssime,\nhic confiténdo iúgiter,\ncalcávit hostem fórtiter,\nsupérbum ac satéllitem.\n\nVirtútum act<i>u</i> et fide,\nconfessiónis órdine,\nIeiúna membra déferens,\ndapes supérnas óbtinet.\n\nPlus currit in certámine\nconféssor iste sústinens,\nquam martyr ictum súfferens,\nmucróne fundens sánguinem.\n\nProínde te, píissime,\nprecámur omnes súpplices,\nut huius almi grátia\nnobis remíttas débita.\n\nGlória Patri Dómino,\nglória Unigénito,\nuna cum Sancto Spíritu\nin sempitérna sǽcula. Amen.\n', NULL, 'Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Hymnarium cisterciense - Lichtenthal 28, folio 50v-51v', 0, NULL),
(9865, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Aeterna Christi munera', 1, 'hy', '2', NULL, 'Kloster Helfta', 'Commune apostolorum et martyrum', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{\\u00c6}</v>(f3f)t\\u00e9r(f)na(e) Chris(d)ti(e) m\\u00fa(f)ne(ef)ra,(f) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v>(,) \\r\\n\\r\\net(g) m\\u00e1r(ij)ty(i)rum(i) vic(f)t\\u00f3(g)ri(f)as,(e) (;) \\r\\nlau(e)des(f) fe(e)r\\u00e9n(f)tes(g) d\\u00e9(i)bi(i)tas(fghGF) (,) \\r\\n\\r\\nl\\u00e6(f)tis(fg) ca(e)n\\u00e1(d)mus(e) m\\u00e9n(f)ti(f)bus.(f) (::) \"', '', 'Ecclesiárum príncipes, \\\\\nbelli triumpháles duces, \\\\\ncæléstis aulæ mílites \\\\\net vera mundi lúmina.\\\\\n\nTerróre victo sǽculi \\\\\npœnísque spretis córporis, \\\\\nmortis sacræ compéndio \\\\\nlucem beátam póssident.\\\\\n\nTradúntur igni mártyres\\\\\net bestiárum déntibus;\\\\\narmáta sævit úngulis\\\\\ntortóris insáni manu. \\\\\n\nNudáta pendent víscera,\\\\\nsanguis sacrátus fúnditur, \\\\\nsed pérmanent immóbiles \\\\\nvitæ perénnis grátia.\\\\\n\nDevóta sanctórum fides, \\\\\ninvícta spes credéntium, \\\\\nperfécta Christi cáritas \\\\\nmundi triúmphat príncipem.\\\\\n\nIn his patérna glória, \\\\\nin his volúntas Spíritus, \\\\\nexsúltat in his Fílius, \\\\\ncælum replétur gáudio.\\\\\n\nTe nunc, Redémptor, quǽsumus, \\\\\nut mártyrum consórtio \\\\\niungas precántes sérvulos \\\\\nin sempitérna sǽcula. Amen.\\\\\n\n', 'Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Hymnarium cisterciense - Lichtenthal 28, folio 49v-50v', 0, NULL),
(9866, NULL, 'Cistercian', 'Deus tuorum militum', 1, 'hy', '7', NULL, 'Kloster Helfta', 'Commune unius mart.', NULL, '\"<v>\\\\textcolor{red}{D}</v>e(c3e)us(g) tu(h)\\u00f3(i)rum(iji) m\\u00ed(hg)li(h)tum(i) <v>\\\\textcolor{red}{*}</v>(,) \\r\\nsors(j) et(k) co(j)r\\u00f3(i)na,(h) pr\\u01fd(g)mi(fef)um,(e) (;) \\r\\nlau(i)des(i) ca(ij)n\\u00e9n(l)tes(k) m\\u00e1r(j)ty(ih)ris(gfg) (,) \\r\\nab(e)s\\u00f3l(g)ve(h) ne(f)xu(g) cr\\u00ed(e)mi(d)nis.(e) (::) \"', 'Hic testis ore prótulit \nquod cordis arca crédidit, \nChristum sequéndo répperit \neffusióne sánguinis.\n\nHic nempe mundi gáudia \net blandiménta nóxia \ncadúca rite députans, \npervénit ad cæléstia.\n\nTempsit tyránni víncula,\ndiras caténas, vérbera;\net voce clara núntiat\nDeum creásse ómnia.\n\nPœnas cucúrrit fórtiter \net sústulit viríliter ; \npro te refúndens sánguinem, \nætérna dona póssidet.\n\nEx hoc furóre væsániæ\niussit perími mártyrem\niustúmque terris óbrui\nquem terra cæli cóntinent.\n\nHinc nos precántes súpplici \nte póscimus, piíssime ; \nin hoc triúmpho mártyris \ndimítte noxam sérvulis,\n\nUt partem huius múneris \nhæreditémus cóngrui, \nlætémur ac perénniter \niuncti polórum átriis.\n\nGlória Patri Dómino,\nGlória Unigénito,\nUna cum Sancto Spíritu\nIn sempitérna sǽcula. Amen.\n', NULL, 'Badische Landesbibliothek Karlsruhe, Hymnarium cisterciense - Lichtenthal 28, folio 48v-49v', 0, NULL),
