(10324, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Lex Domini', 1, 'gr', '3', NULL, 'Jose Carlo Ballon', NULL, NULL, '\"(c3) LEX(e) D\\u00f3(fhg)mi(h)ni(h.) (,) * sem(hi~)per(h) fu(hh//hhh.f!gwh/i_[oh:h]h//j_i/jvIG)it(ig/hi/jh) (,) (hhh\'ih/ihhg.) (;) in(fhg) o(hih/hf)re(hig\'/hiffe.) (,) e(fhg/h_fi/ih/hg)jus :(gv./eg/ihh/fgf.) (:) et(f) in(hf/ghg)\\u00ed(ge/f/hhhvFE\'ec)qui(de)tas(e.) (,) non(e) est(e) in(eg~)v\\u00e9n(g)ta(fgF\'Ef/hh/f/hhhv/GF\'heed.0) (;) in(f) l\\u00e1(hf/gh!ivFE\')bi(feec)is(efe/f/hh) su(gxfe/fgE\'D/efD\'C,ef!hvhv/F\'Eff//ef/ge)is.(c./eec//ed/ec..) (::) \\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. In(e) pa(e.f!gwhgh)ce(h) et(h) \\u00e6(h)qui(hi)t\\u00e1(ih/hgh)te(hg..) (;) am(hj~)bu(jij)l\\u00e1(ji/hhf/ig/h_[oh:h]i_[oh:h]h_[oh:h]/h\'hhvFE/hg/h_i)vit,(ih/ihhg.) (:) et(h) \\u00edm(gh/jij)pi(hg)os(g.) con(g)v\\u00e9r(h.f!gwh_g)tit(gv./eg/ihh/fgf.) (;) * ab(f) in(hf/gh!ivFE\')i(feec)qui(efe/f/hh)t\\u00e1(gxfe/fgE\'D/efD\'C,ef!hvhv/F\'Eff//ef/ge)te.(c./eec//ed/ec..) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Gradual of the proper Mass for the Feast of St. James, Apostle in Spain.\n\nIs there a PDF or picture for the source score? https://forum.musicasacra.com/forum/discussion/20131\n\nSource code in 1909-Missae Propriae Sanctorum qui in Hispania celebrantur (Supplement to the Graduale Romanum N.º 696A, 1910), pages 63-66:\nhttps://mega.nz/file/7doWRZ6Z#DtPDXSnKYCq6-2dqjikNAxMm8Kjlow0P_tTSIFOYO0I\n\nAnd in 1927-Supplementum pro Hispaniae Dioecesibus (Liber Usualis N.º 780A, 1930), pages 55-59:\nhttps://mega.nz/file/qAwC3LxZ#-76g15j5wXnlKFcAvfTMTyBUaetPhEXRJgOWL6nuwK8\n\nI (Verbum Gloriae) scanned both Spanish supplements and uploaded them to my Spanish website of apostolate of Gregorian Chant: https://www.verbumgloriae.es/recursos/libros/#seccion4', 0, NULL),
