(10389, '007731', 'Gregofacsimil', 'Surge Petre', 1, 're', '7', NULL, 'Marek Klein', 'Act 12, 7-8; H281', NULL, '\"(c3)Sur(ei~)ge,(i) Pe(i/jvHGhihijv)tre,(i) (`) et(i) in(i!jwk>)du(ih)e(h) te(h) ve(hg)sti(f)m\\u00e9n(g!hoi>)tis(ih) tu(hfgwhGFEf)is;(fe) (:)\\r\\n\\u00e1c(e/fhgho)ci(g)pe(g) for(g)ti(g!hoi)t\\u00fa(hg)di(g)nem(giHGhvGFEfe) (,) ad(i) sal(ij~)v\\u00e1n(ji/ih~)das(ij) gen(ijij~)tes,(g) (:)\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>()\\r\\nQui(g)a(h) ce(i)ci(h)d\\u00e9(i)runt(hg) ca(f)t\\u00e9(f!gwh/ivHGhwihi)n\\u00e6(ih) (,) de(hi) m\\u00e1(i)ni(g!hi)bus(ijg!hwiHGFgwhGF) tu(efgvFEf)is.(fe) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. \\r\\nAn(i!jwkJI>)ge(hg)lus(hi/hho1!f) au(h<)tem(h) D\\u00f3(hi)mi(h)ni(h) \\u00e1(hi)sti(h)tit(h) (`) et(h) lu(h)men(h) re(h)f\\u00fal(hi~)sit(h) in(h) ha(h)bi(h)t\\u00e1(ig)cu(hi)lo(hi) c\\u00e1r(i)ce(i!jwkj)ris;(ji) (;) per(hi/hhog~)cus(hih)s\\u00f3(ij)que(i) l\\u00e1(i)te(i)re(i) Pe(ij)tri(i) (`) ex(i)ci(i)t\\u00e1(i)vit(i) e(-ikj)um,(hi) di(i!jwkj)cens:(ji) (;)\\r\\nSur(i)ge(-ijijIH) ve(ih)l\\u00f3(h!iwji/jkj)ci(ihiwjij)ter.(ivHGhg) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() Qui(g)a(h) ce(i)ci(h)d\\u00e9(i)runt.(hg) (::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'http://gregofacsimil.free.fr/01-Restitution/Repons/Repons-en-pdf/55-In-nat-Petri-et-Pauli/05-Surge-Petre.pdf', 0, NULL),
(10390, '007787', 'Gregofacsimil', 'Tu es pastor ovium', 1, 're', '8', NULL, 'Marek Klein', 'ꝟ Mt 16, 19; H282', NULL, '\"(c4)Tu(ggh) es(g) pa(g)stor(eg) \\u00f3(f!goh)vi(fe)um,(dec/d!ewfefvED) (;)\\r\\nPrin(f>)ceps(gh) a(ixhiHGFgh)po(g)sto(gh!iwjIHiwjIH)l\\u00f3(ghivHGh)rum,(hg) (:) ti(j)bi(jh) tr\\u00e1(j)di(jk)dit(kjjs) De(jhiwjIHGh)us(hg) (`) \\u00f3m(g)ni(g)a(ixhiHGhih) re(ghf~)gna(goh) mun(hg/hgf~)di;(gf) (:)\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>()\\r\\nEt(fh) \\u00ed(hjg/ho)de(g)o(g) tr\\u00e1(g)di(g)t\\u00e6(e) sunt(g>) ti(fef)bi(dec/d!ewfefvED) (;) cla(f)ves(gh~) re(ixhiHGFgh>)gni(g) c\\u00e6(gh!iwjIHiwjIH)l\\u00f3(ghivHGh)rum.(hg) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. \\r\\nQuod(j)c\\u00fam(ji~)que(jkj/iji/hho1!g) li(hi)g\\u00e1(i)ve(i)ris(i) su(i)per(ih~) ter(jk~)ram(j) (`) e(jk)rit(j) li(j)g\\u00e1(ji)tum(ih) et(ij) in(hi) c\\u00e6(g!hwih)lis,(hg) (;)\\r\\net(g) quod(fg)c\\u00fam(gh~)que(g) s\\u00f3l(gh~)ve(g)ris(g) su(g)per(g) ter(gh~)ram(g) (`) e(gh)rit(g) so(g)l\\u00fa(g)tum(ixhiHGhih) et(ghf) in(gh) c\\u00e6(iyh!iwji/jkJIH)lis.(hiHGhg) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() Et(fh) \\u00ed(hjg/ho)de(g)o(g) tr\\u00e1(g)di(g)t\\u00e6(e) sunt.(g>) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'http://gregofacsimil.free.fr/01-Restitution/Repons/Repons-en-pdf/55-In-nat-Petri-et-Pauli/06-Tu-es-pastor-ovium.pdf', 0, NULL),
(10391, '006630', 'Gregofacsimil', 'Ego pro te rogavi', 1, 're', '3', NULL, 'Marek Klein', 'ꝶ Lc. 22,32 ꝟ Mt.16,17; H282', NULL, '\"(c3)E(e)go(fgf) pro(g) te(-ijij) ro(ig)g\\u00e1(ih/hoi)vi,(ffo1!e) (`) Pe(ihiwjIHG)tre,(ghGFgf) (;)\\r\\nut(e!fwgfghv) non(g) de(g)f\\u00ed(g)ci(fefwgfg)at(gf) fi(g!hwijv)des(i) tu(ig/gwhgh)a;(ghGFgf) (:)\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>()\\r\\nEt(hf~) tu(ghg) a(g)li(-ijij)qu\\u00e1n(ioj>)do(gih/hoi) con(fe~)ver(fgFEfwg/hgf~)sus(gf) (;) con(eg)fir(g!hwih/iji>)ma(hvGFfoefv) fra(e!fhg/hih)tres(gxfvEDewf/ge/fe) tu(cedds)os.(dc) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>.\\r\\nCa(gihhs)ro(f!gwhgffo1!e) et(g) san(gh~)guis(f) non(f) re(f)ve(fe)l\\u00e1(f)vit(h) ti(gihhs)bi,(hg) (;) sed(ge~) Pa(fg)ter(g) me(g!ho)us(g) qui(gihhvGFgwhg) est(fe) in(efgwh) c\\u00e6(hggo!fgvFEf)lis.(fe) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() Et(hf~) tu.(ghg) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'http://gregofacsimil.free.fr/01-Restitution/Repons/Repons-en-pdf/55-In-nat-Petri-et-Pauli/08-Ego-pro-te-rogavi-Petre.pdf', 0, NULL),
(10392, '007467', 'Gregofacsimil', 'Quem dicunt homines', 1, 're', '1', NULL, 'Marek Klein', 'ꝶ Mt.16,13.16.18 ꝟ ibid.18; H282', NULL, '\"(c4)Quem(d) di(dsfss)cunt(dsfss) h\\u00f3(fd)mi(f)nes(-ghg) es(ixhvGFgwhgh/iv)se(h) F\\u00ed(hsjss)li(hg)um(ixg/ivHGh) h\\u00f3(fe)mi(f)nis?(ixg!hwih/ho!g) (;)\\r\\ndi(h)xit(fe) Ie(d)sus(fvvfd/do!c) di(ef)sc\\u00ed(goh)pu(fe)lis(cd) su(d!ewfef)is.(ed) (:)\\r\\nRe(d)sp\\u00f3n(fgoh>)dens(g) Pe(g)trus,(g) di(gfg)xit:(fg/ffo!d) (:)\\r\\nTu(h) es(-ghg) Chri(h)stus(-ghg) F\\u00ed(h)li(g)us(fe) De(g)i(hg) vi(fghvGFg)vi.(gf) (:)\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>()\\r\\nEt(f) e(gh)go(-ghg) di(h)co(-fge) ti(g)bi(ghFEDewf) (;) qui(c)a(d) tu(ge) es(fe) Pe(d)trus,(-dqffv) (;) et(fd~) su(fgf)per(-ghg) hanc(h) pe(hvGFEfwgfg)tram(gf) (,) \\u00e6(f)di(f)fi(f)c\\u00e1(g/goh)bo(c) Ec(d)cl\\u00e9(fg)si(-ghf)am(fe) me(defvEDe)am.(ed) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>.\\r\\nBe(h)\\u00e1(h)tus(h) es,(hg/hggo!f) Si(g)mon(g) Pe(gh)tre,(g) (`) qui(g)a(g) ca(gh)ro(g) et(g) san(gh~)guis(g) non(g) re(g)ve(hf)l\\u00e1(gh)vit(gh) ti(ixh/iio!h)bi,(h) (;) sed(hf~) Pa(gh)ter(h) me(ixhi)us(h) qui(hg/hg) est(hf) in(ixf!gwhg/hih) c\\u00e6(hvGFEfwg/hv)lis.(gf) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() Et(f) e(gh)go(-ghg) di(h)co(-fge) ti(g)bi(ghFEDewf) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'http://gregofacsimil.free.fr/01-Restitution/Repons/Repons-en-pdf/55-In-nat-Petri-et-Pauli/07-Quem-dicunt-homines.pdf', 0, NULL),
