(10614, NULL, 'Simplex', 'Psalmus alleluiaticus E *', 0, 'al', NULL, NULL, 'Mario Zelada', 'Ps. 84', NULL, '\"(f3)<sp>V/</sp>.() Com(i)<alt>Cantor</alt>pla(i)cu(i)\\u00eds(i)ti(i) ti(i)bi,(i) D\\u00f3(i)mi(i)ne,(i) in(i) ter(i)ra(i) <b>tu</b>(jr1)(ir)a,(i) *(:) con(i)ver(i)t\\u00eds(i)ti(i) cap(i)ti(i)vi(i)t\\u00e1(i)<i>tem</i>(ih) <b>Ia</b>(gr1)(gr)cob.(g) <sp>R/</sp>. (::) <alt>Omnes</alt> Al(h)le(g)l\\u00fa(hi)ia,(hhg) al(f)le(e)l\\u00fa(fg~)ia.(g) <sp>V/</sp>.(::)  <alt>Cantor</alt> 2 Re(i)mi(i)s\\u00eds(i)ti.(i) (::)\"', NULL, '2 Remisísti iniquitátem plebis {\\bf tu}æ, * operuísti ómnia peccáta {\\it e}{\\bf ó}rum. {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\n3 Contraxísti omnem iram {\\bf tu}am, * revertísti a furóre indignatió{\\it nis} {\\bf tu}æ. {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\n4 Convérte nos, Deus, salutáris {\\bf no}ster, * et avérte iram tuam {\\it a} {\\bf no}bis. {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\n5 Numquid in aetérnum irascéris {\\bf no}bis, * aut exténdes iram tuam a generatióne in genera{\\it ti}{\\bf ó}nem? {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\n6 Nonne tu convérsus vivifi{\\bf cá}bis nos, * et blebs tua lætábi{\\it tur} {\\bf in} te? {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\n7 Osténde nobis, Dómine, misericórdiam {\\bf tu}am, * et salutáre tuum {\\it da} {\\bf no}bis. {\\rb}. Allelúia.\\\\\n\\\\\nSemper omittitur Glória Patri.', NULL, 0, NULL),
(10615, NULL, 'Simplex', 'Qui te exspectant', 1, 'of', '1', 'f', 'Mario Zelada', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) Qui(d) <alt>Cantor</alt>te(d) ex(c)sp\\u00e9c(f)tant,(g) D\\u00f3(f)mi(gh)ne,(h) *(,)<alt>Omnes</alt> non(ge) con(gh)fun(fe)d\\u00e9n(d)tur.(d) (::f+)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(10616, NULL, 'Simplex', 'Psalmus 24', 0, 'ps', '1', 'f', 'Mario Zelada', NULL, NULL, '\"<alt>Cantor</alt> (c4) <sp>V/</sp>. 1 <i>Ad</i>(f) <i>te,</i>(gh) D\\u00f3(h)mi(h)ne,(h) le(h)v\\u00e1(h)vi(h) <b>\\u00e1</b>(ixir1)ni(hr)mam(h) <b>me</b>(gr1)(hr)am,(h) *(:) De(h)us(h) me(h)us,(h) in(h) te(h) con(h)f\\u00ed(h)do:(h) non(h) <i>e</i>(g)<i>ru</i>(f)<b>b\\u00e9s</b>(ghr1)(gr)cam.(gf)  Ant.(::) <alt>Omnes</alt> Qui(d) te(d) ex(c)spec(f)tant.(g) (::)\"', NULL, 'Intonatio rursus fieri debet initio cuiusque vericuli.\\\\\n\\\\\n2 {\\it Remi}níscere miseratiónum tu{\\bf á}rum, {\\bf Dó}mine, * et misericordiárum tuárum, quóniam a {\\it saecu}{\\bf lo} sunt. Ant. Qui te.\\\\\n\\\\\n3. {\\it Uni}versae viae Dómini misericórdi{\\bf a} et {\\bf vé}ritas * custodiéntibus testaméntum eius et testimó{\\it nia} {\\bf e}ius. Ant. Qui te.\\\\\n\\\\\n4. {\\it Custó}di ánimam meam, et {\\bf é}ru{\\bf e} me; * non erubéscam, quóniam spe{\\it rávi} {\\bf in} te. Ant. Qui te.\\\\\n\\\\\n5. {\\it Líbe}ra, {\\bf De}us, {\\bf Is}rael * ex ómnibus tribulatio{\\it nibus} {\\bf su}is. Ant. Qui te.\\\\', 'Antiphona ad offertorium Missa I Tempus Adventus.', 0, NULL),
(10617, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Ave maris stella', 1, 'hy', '4', NULL, 'Jakub Jelínek', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)\\r\\nA(ffe)ve,(d) ma(c)ris(dfd) stel(e\'_)la,(e_) (,) \\r\\nDe(g)i(g_h/iwji) ma(hg)ter(hih) al(g.)ma,(g.) (;) \\r\\nat(hi)que(h) sem(g)per(h) vir(fe)go,(d_e) (,) \\r\\nfe(ed)lix(cd) c\\u00e6(f)li(fgf) por(ede)ta.(e.) (::)\"', '2. Su(ffe)mens(d) il(c)lud(dfd) «{A}(e\'_)v{e}»(e_) (,)\nGa(g)bri(g_h/iwji)é(hg)lis(hih) o(g.)re,(g.) (;)\nfun(hi)da(h) nos(g) in(h) pa(fe)ce,(d_e) (,)\nmu(ed)tans(cd) E(f)væ(fgf) no(ede)men.(e.) (::)\n\n3. Sol(ffe)ve(d) vin(c)cla(dfd) re(e\'_)is,(e_) (,)\npro(g)fer(g_h/iwji) lu(hg)men(hih) cæ(g.)cis,(g.) (;)\nma(hi)la(h) no(g)stra(h) pel(fe)le,(d_e) (,)\nbo(ed)na(cd) cun(f)cta(fgf) po(ede)sce.(e.) (::)\n\n4. Mon(ffe)stra(d) t<i>e</i> {e}s(c)se(dfd) ma(e\'_)trem,(e_) (,)\nsu(g)mat(g_h/iwji) per(hg) te(hih) pre(g.)cem(g.) (;)\nqui(hi) pro(h) no(g)bis(h) na(fe)tus(d_e) (,)\ntu(ed)lit(cd) es(f)se(fgf) tu(ede)us.(e.) (::)\n\n5. Vir(ffe)go(d) sin(c)gu(dfd)lá(e\'_)ris,(e_) (,)\nin(g)ter(g_h/iwji) om(hg)nes(hih) mi(g.)tis,(g.) (;)\nnos(hi) cul(h)pis(g) so(h)lú(fe)tos(d_e) (,)\nmi(ed)tes(cd) fac(f) et(fgf) ca(ede)stos.(e.) (::)\n\n6. Vi(ffe)tam(d) præ(c)sta(dfd) pu(e\'_)ram,(e_) (,)\ni(g)ter(g_h/iwji) pa(hg)ra(hih) tu(g.)tum,(g.) (;)\nut(hi) vi(h)dén(g)tes(h) Ie(fe)sum(d_e) (,)\nsem(ed)per(cd) col(f)læ(fgf)té(ede)mur.(e.) (::)\n\n7. Sit(ffe) laus(d) De(c)o(dfd) Pa(e\'_)tri,(e_) (,)\nsum(g)mo(g_h/iwji) Chri(hg)sto(hih) de(g.)cus,(g.) (;)\nSpi(hi)rí(h)tu(g)i(h) San(fe)cto(d_e) (,)\nho(ed)nor,(cd) tri(f)bus(fgf) u(ede)nus.(e.) (::)\n\nA(efe)men.(de..) (::)', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(10618, NULL, NULL, 'Benignitatem fecit Dominus', 1, 'co', '8', 'g', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)Be(g)<alt>Cantor</alt>ni(f)gni(h)t\\u00e1(j)tem(ig) *(,)<alt>Omnes</alt> fe(ij)cit(hg) D\\u00f3(h)mi(g)nus,(f) (;) et(g) ter(f)ra(h) nos(j)tra(ig) (,) de(ij)dit(h) fruc(i)tum(h) su(g)um.(g) (::) (g+)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Antiphona ad communionem Missa I Tempus Adventus', 0, NULL),
(10619, NULL, NULL, 'Psalmus 84', 0, 'ps', '8', 'g', 'Mario Zelada', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) <c><alt>Cantor</alt></c> <c><sp>V/</sp>. 1</c> <i>Au</i>(g)<i>di</i>(h)am(j) quid(j) lo(j)qu\\u00e1(j)tur(j) D\\u00f3(j)mi(j)nus(j) <b>De</b>(jr1)us,(h) \\u2020(,) qu\\u00f3n(j)i(j)am(j) lo(j)qu\\u00e9(j)tur(j) pa(j)cem(j) ad(j) ple(j)bem(j) su(j)am(j) et(j) sanc(j)tos(j) <b>su</b>(kr1)(jr)os,(j) *(:) et(j) ad(j) e(j)os(j) qui(j) con(j)ver(j)<i>t\\u00fan</i>(i)<i>tur</i>(j) <b>cor</b>(hr1)(gr)de.(g) Ant.(::)<alt>Omnes</alt> Be(g)ni(f)gni(h)t\\u00e1(j)tem.(ig) (::)\"', NULL, '{\\color{gregoriocolor}Intonatio rursus fieri debet initio cuiusque versiculi.}\\\\\n\\\\\n{\\color{gregoriocolor}2} {\\it Verúm}tamen prope timéntes eum salutáre ip{\\bf sí}us, * ut inhábitatet glória in {\\it terra} {\\bf nos}tra. {\\color{gregoriocolor}Ant.} Benignitátem.\\\\\n\\\\\n{\\color{gregoriocolor}3} {\\it Mise}ricórdia et véritas obviavérunt {\\bf si}bi, * iustítia et pax {\\it oscu}{\\bf lá}tae sunt. {\\color{gregoriocolor}Ant.} Benignitátem.\\\\\n\\\\\n{\\color{gregoriocolor}4} {\\it Véri}tas de terra {\\bf or}ta est, * et iustítia de {\\it caelo pro}{\\bf spé}xit. {\\color{gregoriocolor}Ant.} Benignitátem.\\\\\n\\\\\n{\\color{gregoriocolor}5} {\\it Iustí}tia ante eum ambu{\\bf lá}bit, * et ponet in via {\\it gressus} {\\bf su}os. {\\color{gregoriocolor}Ant.} Benignitátem.\n', 'Antiphona ad communionem Missa I Tempus Adventus', 0, NULL),
