(10948, '006461', 'Gregofacsimil', 'Disrumpam vincula populi', 1, 're', '8', NULL, 'Marek Klein', 'ꝟ 1Mac 6,19; H415', NULL, '\"(c4)DIs(d)r\\u00fam(f/g!h>)pam(g) v\\u00edn(gh~)cu(g)la(g) p\\u00f3(g)pu(g)li(ixg!hoi) me(h)i,(ixhg/h!iwjghvggof) (;)\\r\\ndi(jvvIH)cit(i!jwkJIHiwjIH) D\\u00f3(g)mi(ghivHGh)nus,(g!hih) (:)\\r\\net(f) di(h)sp\\u00e9r(jkj)dam(jh) \\u00f3m(-hji)ni(jk)a(k) ma(ki/jkhiv)la(hhog) (,) qu\\u00e6(f) in(f)d\\u00fa(ixhih)xi(hg) su(i)per(jijvIHG) e(hghvGFg)um.(gf) (:)\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>()\\r\\nEt(fh) \\u00e1u(hjgh)fe(g)ram(g) u(g)ni(g)v\\u00e9r(g)sum(e) la(g)b\\u00f3(fef)rem(dec/d!ewfefvED) (,) a(d) f\\u00e1(f/gh)ci(g)e(gh) ter(h)r\\u00e6(ixhg/hig/gf) (;)\\r\\net(gh) a(g) ci(gh)vi(g)t\\u00e1(g)te(gh!iwjIHiwjIH) i(ghivHGh)sta.(hg) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>.\\r\\nRe(j)f\\u00fal(ji~)sit(jkj/iji/hhog) sol(hi) in(i) cl\\u00fd(ih)pe(ij)os(hi) \\u00e1u(g)re(g!hwih)os,(hg) (;) et(g) res(fg)plen(g)du(g)\\u00e9(gh)runt(g) mon(ixhiHGhih)tes(ghf) ab(gh) e(iyh!iwji/jkJIH)is.(hiHGhg) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n<v>\\\\greheightstar</v>() Et(fh) \\u00e1u(hjgh)fe(g)ram.(g) (::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'http://gregofacsimil.free.fr/01-Restitution/Repons/Repons-en-pdf/81-De-Libro-Machabaeorum/13-Disrumpam-vincula-populi.pdf', 0, NULL),
(10949, NULL, 'Simplex', 'Tonus 2', 0, 'co', NULL, NULL, 'Mario Zelada', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) <sp>V/</sp> 1 Be(h)ne(h)d\\u00ed(h)cam(h) D\\u00f3(h)mi(h)num(h) in(h) om(h)ni(h) <b>t\\u00e9m</b>(gr1)po(fr)re,(f) *(:) sem(h)per(h) laus(h) e(h)ius(h) in(h) o(h)re(h) <b>me</b>(gr1)(hr)o.(h) <sp>R/</sp>(::) Al(h)le(g)l\\u00fa(h)ia,(g) (,) al(g)le(f)l\\u00fa(g)ia,(h) al(ixi)le(g)l\\u00fa(i)ia.(h) (::Z) vel <sp>R/</sp> Gus(h)t\\u00e1(h)te(g) (,) quam(f) su(g)\\u00e1(h)vis(ixi) D\\u00f3(g)mi(ixi)nus(h) (::)\"', NULL, '2 In Dómino gloriábitur ánima {\\bf me}a,  áudiant mansuéti et lae{\\bf tén}tur. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n3 Magnificáte Dóminum {\\bf me}cum, * et exaltémus nomen eius in id{\\bf íp}sum. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n4 Exquisívi Dóminum, et exau{\\bf dí}vit me, * et ex ómnibus terróribus meis erípu{\\bf it} me. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n5 Respícite ad eum, et illumi{\\bf ná}mini, * et fácies vestrae non confun{\\bf dén}tur. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n6 Iste pauper clamávit, et Dóminus exaudívit {\\bf e}um, * et de ómnibus tribulatiónibus eius salvávit {\\bf e}um. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n7 Vallábit ángelus Dómini in circúitu timéntes {\\bf e}um, * et erípiet {\\bf e}os. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n8 Timéte Dóminum, sancti {\\bf e}ius, * quóniam non est inópia timéntibus {\\bf e}um. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n9 Dívites eguérunt et esuri{\\bf é}runt, * iniquiréntes autem Dóminum non defícien omni {\\bf bo}no. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n10 Veníte, fílii, au{\\bf dí}te me: * timórem Dómini do{\\bf ce}bo vos. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n12 Quis est homo qui vult {\\bf vi}tam, * díligit dies ut vídeat {\\bf bo}num? R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n13 Divérte a malo et fac {\\bf bo}num, * inquíre pacem et perséquere {\\bf e}am. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n14 Oculi Dómini super {\\bf iu}stos, * et aures eius in clamórem e{\\bf ó}rum. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n15 Vultus autem Dómini super faciéntes {\\bf ma}la, * ut perdat de terra memóriam e{\\bf ó}rum. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n16 Clamavérunt, et Dóminus exau{\\bf dí}vit, * et ex ómnibus tribulatiónibus eórum liberávit {\\bf e}os. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n17 Iuxta est Dóminus iis qui contríto sunt {\\bf cor}de, * et confráctos spíritu sal{\\bf vá}bit. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n18 Multae tribulatiónes iu{\\bf stó}rum, * et de ómnibus his liberábit eos {\\bf Dó}minus. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n19 Custódit ómnia ossa e{\\bf ó}rum, * unum ex his non conte{\\bf ré}tur. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n20 Interfíciet peccatórem ma{\\bf lí}tiam * et qui odérunt iustum, puniéntur. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\n21 Rédimet Dóminus ánimas servórum su{\\bf ó}rum, * et non puniéntur omnes qui sperant in {\\bf e}o. R. Gustáte.\\\\\n\\\\\nAdditur ad libitum:\\\\\n\\\\\nGlória Patri, et Fílio, et Spirítui Sancto. \' Sicut erat in princípio et nunc et {\\bf sem}per, * et in saécula saeculórum. {\\bf A}men. R. Gustáte.', 'Huc tonus usurpari potest, praesertim tempore Quadragesimae cum R. Gustáte, ut infra.', 0, NULL),
