(11811, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Salve mira creatura', 1, 'ca', '1', NULL, 'Andrew Hinkley', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) Sal(h)ve(hg) mi(h)ra(e) cre(f)a(g)t\\u00fa(h)ra,(g) (;) O(g) Ma(gf)r\\u00ed(g)a,(d) vir(e)go(f) pu(g)ra,(f) (;) Stu(h)pet(hg) in(h) te(j) jam(i) na(g)t\\u00fa(h)ra(h) (;) A(k)mi(ji)s\\u00eds(h)se(g) su(e)a(f) ju(g)ra,(e) (;) Pa(g)rens(gf) di(d)v\\u00e6(c) Pro(fh)lis.(g) <sp>R/</sp>.(::) O(hhg) cle(fe)mens,(d) (;) O(hhg) pi(fe)a,(d) (;) O(ffe) dul(g)cis(h) Vir(g)go(g) Ma(h)r\\u00ed(fe)a.(d) (::)\"', NULL, '\\begin{longtable}{ll}\n2. &Cum creáris, absque mora\\\\\n&Tota sancta et decóra;\\\\\n&Non est in te nubis hora,\\\\\n&Tota corúscans auróra\\\\\n&Justitiæ solis.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n3. &Salve cæli plena rore,\\\\\n&Gaudens et Matris honóre\\\\\n&Et Virginitátis flore,\\\\\n&Cum in lílii candóre\\\\\n&Génitrix es facta.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n4. &Fons exúndans gaudiórum,\\\\\n&Paris Regem Angelórum\\\\\n&In salútem populórum,\\\\\n&Captivórum et reórum,\\\\\n&O mater intácta!\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n5. &Eva, dum credit serpénti\\\\\n&Mortem tulit toti genti;\\\\\n&Sed tu, Angelo loquénti\\\\\n&Fidens, mísere jacénti\\\\\n&Effugásti luctum.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n6. &Tu es tellus non labóre\\\\\n&Fecundáta vel sudóre,\\\\\n&Sed cælésti tantum rore;\\\\\n&Agri pleni cum odóre\\\\\n&Germinásti fructum.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n7. &Tu excéllis, Virgo digna,\\\\\n&Sicut cedrus inter ligna;\\\\\n&Te præmonstrant multa signa\\\\\n&Genitúram, o benigna,\\\\\n&Mundi Salvatórem.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n8. &Virga te signat frondósa\\\\\n&Aaron prodigiósa,\\\\\n&Quæ dat valde speciósa,\\\\\n&Miro dono pretiósa,\\\\\n&Fructuósum florem.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n9. &O Virgínitas beáta,\\\\\n&Mosis rubo figuráta,\\\\\n&Cujus Prophétæ monstráta\\\\\n&Flamma, vi sua priváta,\\\\\n&Ardens non urébat.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n10. &Virgo mater Deo grata,\\\\\n&Imbre cæli inundáta,\\\\\n&Gedeónis te lanáta\\\\\n&De supérnis irroráta\\\\\n&Vellus prædicébat.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n11. &Salve, cælum tangens scala,\\\\\n&A mundo repélle mala\\\\\n&Quæ dedérunt Adæ mala:\\\\\n&Ut plebs fac tua sub ala\\\\\n&Sit Christo fidélis.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n12. &Fac pro tua pietáte\\\\\n&Ut stantes in veritáte,\\\\\n&Virtútis integritáte,\\\\\n&Fruámur societáte\\\\\n&Sanctórum in cælis.\\\\\n\\Rbar. O clemens.\n\\end{longtable}\n', NULL, 0, NULL),
