(13189, NULL, 'Solesmes', 'Sancta Maria', 1, 'ca', '1', NULL, 'Andrew Hinkley', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) San(d)cta(h) Ma(h)r\\u00ed(g)a,(g) (;) Te(f) de(h)cus(j) o(g)mne(g) (;) C\\u00e6(e)li(g)tus(f) or(e)nat,(d) (;) Te(e)que(c) su(e)p\\u00e9r(g)na(f) (;) Gr\\u00e1(e)ti(d)a(f) re(d)plet.(d) <sp>R/</sp>.(::) O(h) pi(h)a(d) Vir(f)go,(f) (;) Ma(g)ter(g) et(f) al(h)ma,(h) (;) No(j)stra(j) be(g)n\\u00ed(f)gne(h) (;) S\\u00fa(f)ci(f)pe(d) vo(e)ta.(d) (::)\"', NULL, '\\begin{longtable}{ll}\n2. &Casta colúmba\\\\\n&Advenis orbi\\\\\n&Núntia vitæ,\\\\\n&Pacis in ore\\\\\n&Pígnora portans.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n3. &Astra tenéntis\\\\\n&Fília Regis\\\\\n&Magna poténsque:\\\\\n&Nam super omnes\\\\\n&Tu benedícta.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n4. &Múnere divo\\\\\n&Sola fuísti\\\\\n&Néscia culpæ,\\\\\n&Tota refúlgens\\\\\n&Lúmine sancto.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n5. &Tu paradísus!\\\\\n&Quam tua pulchra\\\\\n&Lília vernant,\\\\\n&Atque rosárum\\\\\n&Púrpura splendet!\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n6. &Quod rea mortis\\\\\n&Abstulit Eva,\\\\\n&Ecce salútis\\\\\n&Tu reparátrix\\\\\n&Gérmine reddis.\\\\\n&R, O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n7. &Clausa per Evam\\\\\n&Jánua cæli\\\\\n&Jam patet ad nos,\\\\\n&Te mediánte,\\\\\n&Rursus apérta.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n8. &Spléndida stella,\\\\\n&Per maris undas\\\\\n&Ne pereámus,\\\\\n&Fulget amíca\\\\\n&Lux tua ductrix.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n9. &Nostra dat intus\\\\\n&Vita timóres:\\\\\n&Cúrrimus ad te:\\\\\n&Nunc et in hora\\\\\n&Mortis adésto.\\\\\n&R. O pia.\n\\end{longtable}\n', NULL, 0, NULL),
