(14223, NULL, 'Offertoriale 1935', 'Tollite portas', 1, 'of', '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3) TOl(ce/fgf)li(f)te(f) por(f!gwh/ig/hffe~)tas,(f) (,) pr\\u00edn(f/hhh)ci(h)pes,(hji) ve(ih//hhhvFEf!gwhf)stras :(f) (:) et(fge) e(h)le(hif)v\\u00e1(hhhjvIHhvGF)mi(gf)ni,(f) (;) por(f!gwh/ihhvG~F~)tae(f) ae(hfh)ter(efe~)n\\u00e1(hi!kvJI)les,(ih) (:) * Et(hf) in(hi)tro(ih)\\u00ed(hfivHGF)bit(fhffe) (;) Rex(ef!hhi) gl\\u00f3(jkIH)ri(hg)ae.(hhhf) (,) (h/ihhh//hhhf/ih/ghf//ihhhhefv) (::) \\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. 1. D\\u00f3(hh)mi(hg)ni(hig/hif) est (fe/f/hh) ter(f)ra(f/hhivHF) (;) et(f) ple(e)ni(f)t\\u00fa(hh)do(hf/hji) e(hi//hhhf)(;)(hhhhihiih/ihh)ius :(fgf) (:) or(fh)bis(hhh) ter(f/hhhh)r\\u00e1(e/fgf)rum(f) (;) et(f) u(e)ni(f)v\\u00e9r(f/hhhvFEhhhvFEDegf)si,(f) (;) qui(ef) h\\u00e1(fh)bi(h)tant(ih/if) in(ef) e(fhGF)o.(fe) (::) ()* Et intro\\u00edbit.() (z0::f3) \\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. 2 I(bf)pse(f) su(f)per(fe) m\\u00e1(f/hhf)ri(fe)a(f) fun(f)d\\u00e1(fe/f/hhivHF)vit(f) e(dxfdevDCBcdb)um(b) (:) et(ba) su(dxd)per(efe) fl\\u00fa(f/hhf)mi(fe!fwgfg)na(gf) (;) prae(dxd)pa(efe)r\\u00e1(f)vit(fe) e(fh!ivHGhiHFhhf/efef)(;)(fh!ivHGhiHFhhf/efef)(;)(fhFEf/hhhegvFE)(;)(e!fwgf/ggfg/e!fwgfg)um.(dyge/ghf/ee/cdc) (::) ()* Et intro\\u00edbit.() (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
