\nCum(hi) Patr<e>e</e>,(g) et(fg) al(e)mo(dc) Spí(d)ri(de)tu,(e) (,)\nIn(c) sem(d)pi(eg)tér(gf)na(ede) sǽ(f)cu(e)la.(d) (::) \nA(ded)men.(cd) (::) \n', NULL, 'Considerable effort has been made to preserve the location of the existing line breaks.  Users with different line lengths should remove all copies of letter z, all braces { } and all <nlba>, </nlba> tags from the score.  Search and replace by empty string will work fine.', 0, NULL),
