(16735, NULL, 'Solesmes 1957', 'Beata es Virgo Maria quae (Resp w/o Gloria Patri)', 1, 're', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) BE(d)\\u00e1(d)ta(dfd\'___dc) es,(f\'_) *(,) Vir(g)go(f\') Ma(g)r\\u00ed(g_[uh:l]h_G_F\'gwhg/h_i)a,(h.) (,) qu\\u00e6(f) D\\u00f3(gh)mi(h)num(hg\'ge\') por(g)t\\u00e1(ghf\'fvED)sti,(d_0//ef_d\'_/e_d\'dc.) (;) Cre(fe)a(fg)t\\u00f3(g_[oh:h]f)rem(ev_[oh:h]D_[oh:h]C\'dwe_[oh:h]DC\'d) mun(d!ewfef)di :(ed..) (:) * Ge(f)nu(gh)\\u00ed(h)sti(hg/hiHGg) qui(e) te(g) fe(ghf\'fvED)cit,(d_0//ef_d\'_/e_d\'dc.) (;) et(dfED\'e) in(c) \\u00e6(d)t\\u00e9r(d!ewf!gv_[oh:h]F_[oh:h]E\'/!fwg!hv_G~F~)num(gf..) (,) p\\u00e9r(fgf\'fe)ma(dc)nes(e) Vir(egF_E_2fv_E_D\'ewfef)go.(ed..) (::) \\r\\n<sp>V/</sp>. A(h)ve,(hg/hg\'gf) Ma(g)r\\u00ed(gh)a,(g.) (,) gr\\u00e1(hf)ti(gh)a(gh) ple(h_/iih)na :(h.) (;) D\\u00f3(hg/hg)mi(gf)nus(f!gwhg/hih) te(hv_GF_5E\'_fw!g_[uh:l]h)cum.(gf..) (::) * Ge(f)nu(gh)\\u00ed(h)sti.(hg/hiHGg) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(16736, NULL, 'Solesmes 2019', 'Sancta et immaculata', 1, 're', '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3) SAn(f)cta(fhffe)(/) *(,) et(f) im(ge~)ma(f)cu(h)l\\u00e1(ghGFE/fg)ta(f) vir(f!gwh/ihhg>)g\\u00ed(f)ni(fg!hvGFg)tas,(gf) (;) qu\\u00ed(f)bus(-fhg) te(h) l\\u00e1u(hji>)di(ivHG/hvGFg)bus(gf) (,) \\u00e9f(f)fe(fg!hvGFE)ram,(f) (`) n\\u00e9(hg/hih)sci(hvGFg)o:(ffe) (:) * Qui(e)a(e) quem(fh~) ca\\u00e9(h)li(hg) c\\u00e1(fg)pe(f)re(fe) non(g>) p\\u00f3t(f/gf/go@hv)e(e)rant,(cd/ceDC/dvCBcb) (;) t\\u00fa(e)o(fg) gr\\u00e9(ghg)mi(e@fo@gv)o(g) con(h)tu(hg)l\\u00ed(fgf)sti.(f) (::) <sp>V/</sp>. Be(f)ne(e)d\\u00ed(ef!gwhhi)cta(h) tu(ij) in(ig~) mu(hi)li(gh)\\u00e9(f)ri(f!gwhg)bus,(gf) (;) et(f) be(ef)ne(f)d\\u00ed(fg)ctus(f) fr\\u00fa(f)ctus(f!gwhGFE) v\\u00e9n(f)tris(hg/hih) t\\u00fa(hvGFg)i.(ffe) (::) * Qui(e)a.(e) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Taken from the Liber Hymnarius, 2019 edition. p. 491. ', 0, NULL),
