(16741, '003677', 'Solesmes 2000s', 'Magnum haereditatis mysterium', 1, 'an', '2', 'a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c3) MA(fe/f!gwh!ivHGF)gnum(f) *(,) h\\u00e6(f)re(e)di(f)t\\u00e1(h)tis(hg) m\\u00fd(f)st\\u00e9(e!gwh!ivHGF/ggof)ri(ef)um:(f) (:) tem(i)plum(i) D\\u00e9(i)i(h) fa(i)ctus(hg) est(f) (,) \\u00fa(h)te(hg)rus(e) n\\u00e9(fh)sci(fe)ens(fhg~) vi(f)rum:(f) (:) non(f) est(f) pol(f)l\\u00fa(h)tus(f) (,) ex(e) e(de)a(e) car(f!gwhg~)nem(e) as(-eg)s\\u00fa(f)mens:(f) (:) O(fe/fed~)mnes(df) gen(hi>)tes(h) (,) v\\u00e9(i)ni(hg)ent,(f) di(e)c\\u00e9n(fe>)tes:(d) (;) Gl\\u00f3(f)ri(e)a(d) ti(e)bi(f) D\\u00f3(f!gwh!ivHGF/gf)mi(ef)ne.(f) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
