(17743, NULL, 'Annamitice', 'Lux aeterna', 1, 'co', '8', NULL, 'Nguyễn Thiện Tuấn Hoàng', NULL, NULL, '[[\"gabc\",\"(c4)V\\u0129nh(h) quang(gf) s\\u00e1ng(gh) soi,(g.) (,) l\\u1ea1y(h) Ch\\u00faa(j) xin(i) h\\u00e3y(j) chi\\u1ebfu(h) l\\u00ean(g) h\\u1ed3n(fg) ai,(g.) (:) c\\u00f9ng(h) mu\\u00f4n(j) v\\u00e0n(i) th\\u00e1nh(j) nh\\u01a1n(h) tr\\u00ean(i) n\\u01b0\\u1edbc(j) thi\\u00ean(h) \\u0111\\u00e0ng,(ghg.) (,) v\\u00ec(e) ch\\u01b0ng(f) Ch\\u00faa(gh) r\\u1ea5t(h) khoan(g) nh\\u01a1n.(g.) (::Z) Nguy\\u1ec7n(g) Cha(h) ban(j) cho(j) ch\\u01b0(j) vong(j) linh(j) \\u0111ang(j) kh\\u1ed5(k) \\u0111au,(j.) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>(;) \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c(j) ngh\\u1ec9(i) ng\\u01a1i(j) y\\u00ean(h) b\\u00ecnh.(g.) (::) C\\u00f9ng(h) mu\\u00f4n(j) v\\u00e0n(i) th\\u00e1nh(j) nh\\u01a1n(h) tr\\u00ean(i) n\\u01b0\\u1edbc(j) thi\\u00ean(h) \\u0111\\u00e0ng,(ghg.) (,) v\\u00ec(e) ch\\u01b0ng(f) Ch\\u00faa(gh) r\\u1ea5t(h) khoan(g) nh\\u01a1n.(g.) (::) V\\u0129nh(h) quang(gf) s\\u00e1ng(gh) soi.(g.::) L\\u1ea1i(g) xin(h) ban(j) mu\\u00f4n(j) \\u00e1nh(k) quang,(j.) <v>\\\\greheightstar</v>(;) soi(i) chi\\u1ebfu(j) cho(h) h\\u1ecd.(g.) (::) C\\u00f9ng(h) mu\\u00f4n(j) v\\u00e0n(i) th\\u00e1nh(j) nh\\u01a1n(h) tr\\u00ean(i) n\\u01b0\\u1edbc(j) thi\\u00ean(h) \\u0111\\u00e0ng,(ghg.) (,) v\\u00ec(e) ch\\u01b0ng(f) Ch\\u00faa(gh) r\\u1ea5t(h) khoan(g) nh\\u01a1n.(g.) (::) V\\u0129nh(h) quang(gf) s\\u00e1ng(gh) soi.(g.::)\\r\\n\",{}],[\"tex\",\"\\\\item 1. L\\u1ea1y T\\u00f4n Ch\\u00faa xin ngu\\u00f4i c\\u01a1n o\\u00e1n tr\\u00e1ch l\\u1ed7i con, * xin khoan nh\\u01a1n ng\\u01b0ng tra tay kh\\u1ecfi c\\u01a1n l\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00ecnh.\\r\\n\\\\item 2. Nguy\\u1ec7n l\\u00f2ng Cha th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng cho con, \\u0111\\u00e2y con y\\u1ebfu \\u0111au, * \\u0111\\u00e2y x\\u01b0\\u01a1ng con tan hoang \\u0111ang ch\\u1edd cha ch\\u1eefa l\\u00e0nh.\\r\\n\\\\item 3. L\\u00f2ng con th\\u1ea3o \\u0111ang mong tr\\u00f4ng l\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ebfn Cha, * \\u00f4i Cha con, con tr\\u00f4ng l\\u00ean Cha xin \\u0111\\u1eebng \\u0111\\u1ec3 con th\\u1eb9n.\\r\\n\\\\item 4. Ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ra tay lui xa qu\\u00e2n binh \\u0111ang qu\\u00e2y b\\u1eaft con, * cho ai \\u0111ang tr\\u00f4ng l\\u00ean Cha, Cha \\u0111\\u1eebng \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00fang ng\\u1eb7t.\\r\\n\\\\item 5. \\u0110\\u1ed3ng xanh t\\u01b0\\u01a1i Cha ch\\u0103n nu\\u00f4i t\\u00f4i, t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e2u thi\\u1ebfu chi, * n\\u01a1i \\u0111\\u00e2y Cha cho t\\u00f4i vui s\\u1ed1ng trong r\\u00e0n.\\r\\n\\\\item 6. Ng\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u00eam Cha \\u0111\\u01b0a t\\u00f4i vui ch\\u01a1i b\\u00ean su\\u1ed1i n\\u01b0\\u1edbc trong, * cho linh h\\u1ed3n t\\u00f4i b\\u00ecnh ph\\u1ee5c.\",{}]]', '', '', NULL, 0, NULL),
