(ef)a:(e.) (;) ef(c)f\\u00fa(e)sum(f) est(f) in(f) ter(f)ra(f) je(e)cur(f) me(g)um(f.) (,) su(f)per(f) con(f)tri(f)ti(f)\\u00f3(f)ne(f) f\\u00ed(f)li(f)\\u00e6(f) p\\u00f3(f)pu(f)li(f) me(ef)i,(f.) (:) cum(h) de(i)f\\u00ed(j)ce(j)ret(j) p\\u00e1r(j)vu(j)lus(j) et(j) lac(ij)tens(j.) (,) in(j) pla(j)t\\u00e9(i)is(h) \\u00f3p(j)pi(i)di.(iif/hv_GFgv_FEef.) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\nJe(c)r\\u00fa(e)sa(f)lem,(f_) Je(e)r\\u00fa(g)sa(e)lem,(f.) (,) con(h)v\\u00e9r(ij)te(j)re(j) ad(j) D\\u00f3(j)mi(j)num(j) De(i)um(h) tu(j)um.(iif/hv_GFgv_FEef.) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL),
(18406, NULL, 'Triplex/Improved', 'Laetare Jerusalem', 1, 'in', '5', NULL, 'Christopher Jasper', NULL, NULL, '\"annotation: Intr;\\r\\nannotation: 5;\\r\\nnabc-lines: 1;\\r\\n%width: 5;\\r\\n%height: 9;\\r\\n%spacing: ;\\r\\n%font: GaramondPremierPro;\\r\\n%%\\r\\n(c3) LAe(d|////ta)t\\u00e1(gxdge/fv|///////toS2lsl2lse4vi)re(ed__|///cl-) *() Je(d|talse4)r\\u00fa(e|//vi)sa(f|//vilsm2)lem :(hvhv|////bv) (;) et(h|///vi) con(hf~|///vi>)v\\u00e9n(hji|/////to>)tum(hg__|///cl-) f\\u00e1(hji|////tolsl2)ci(hg__|///cl-)te(hsss/fgf___|/////ts-////toSlsi4) (;) o(f|talse4)mnes(hi/HFfod|pesu2lss4///pi) qui(f|///vi) di(f|///vi)l\\u00ed(gxg>|///////vi>)gi(egf|/////to)tis(ggv/f!efw!gv_FE|//////bvsut2ql-su2) e(de!fv_EDe|//////ci-pp2)am :(ed..|////cl-) (:) gau(fh~|///pe~)d\\u00e9(h|///vi)te(f|///ta) cum(hgh|////po>) lae(e|////ta)t\\u00ed(gxfgf|/////////to)ti(ded___|///toSlsi4)a,(d|///ta) (,) qui(d|talse4) in(e|///vi) tri(f|///vi)st\\u00ed(gx//fv_//ghf|//////vi-lse4to)ti(f.e!fwgfg|///cllss9ql!po)a(gf__|///cl-) (,) fu(fs!hssivHGF|tsMlse4////ci1lss2)\\u00ed(gxf.e!fwgfg|////////cl-ql!po)stis:(gf..|///cl-) (:) ut(f|talse4) ex(fe|///cl)sul(h|//vilsl2)t\\u00e9(hji|tolse4lss2)tis,(ih__|cl-lse4) (,) et(hsss|/////tslsc6) sa(e|///talsi4)ti(g|//vilss2)\\u00e9(gi/jij|/////popp2)mi(hih___GFg|/////toSsu2//vi)ni(gf..|///cl-) (;) ab(d|///talsi9) u(ef|///pe)b\\u00e9(gxffo!gv|/////////sa)ri(e|////pu)bus(hvhv|////bv) (,) con(d|///talsi9)so(ef|///pe)la(f|///vi)ti(h|///vilsl2)\\u00f3(h_//ivH//Ef|vi-lse4ciSlsi8//vi)nis(gxfhf!e!fw!gv_FE|//////toS2sut1lse4lss2//ql-su2) ve(de!fv_ED/e|//////ci-pp2//vi)strae.(ed..|//////cl-) (::) <i>Ps.</i> Lae(d|///ta)t\\u00e1(f|///vi)tus(h|///vi) sum(h|///vi) in(h|///vi) his(h|///vi) quae(h|///vi) di(h|///vi)cta(h|///vi) sunt(i|///vilss2) mi(i|///vi)hi:(hg__|///cl) *(:) in(hf~|///cl~) do(gh|///pe)mum(h|///vi) D\\u00f3(i|///vi)mi(g|///vi)ni(g|///ta) \\u00ed(h|///vi)bi(g|///vi)mus.(fe//fvED/e.|//////clciS//vi) (::) Gl\\u00f3(d)ri(f)a(h) Pa(h)tri.(h) (::) <eu>E(h) u(h) o(i) u(g) a(h) e.</eu>(fe//fvEDe.) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'I have type-set this chant with Einsiedeln notation above, an updated square notation to more accurately reflect the Swiss neumes and some very minor melodic restorations (a few b-flats should be on \"a\").\nSquare note source: 1974 Graduale Romanum/Triplex\nEinsiedeln source: codex 121, page 147 (https://e-codices.unifr.ch/en/sbe/0121/147)\nLaon source (not graphically represented): codex 239, page 68 (https://imslp.org/wiki/Gradual,_F-LA_Ms_239_(Gregorian_Chant))', 0, NULL),
(18407, NULL, 'Improved', 'Reminiscere', 1, 'in', '4', NULL, 'Christopher Jasper', NULL, NULL, '\"annotation: Intr\\r\\nannotation: 4\\r\\n%%\\r\\n\\r\\n(c4) RE(d)mi(fd)n\\u00ed(efo)sce(e)re(e.) *(,) mi(fsss)se(fd)ra(fe)ti(f)\\u00f3(fhg)num(f) (`) tu(fsss)\\u00e1(fde)rum,(EF/ghf!e) (,) D\\u00f3(e)mi(eg/FE)ne,(e.) (:) et(fsss) mi(fd)se(fe)ri(f)c\\u00f3r(fhg>)di(f)ae(e) tu(egFE)ae,(e.) (;) quae(fsss) a(fd) sa\\u00e9(eg)cu(f)lo(gvFD) sunt :(d_//fvEDf.) (:) ne(d) un(ffd~)quam(fvv) do(c)mi(dfe)n\\u00e9n(f)tur(dg~) no(gf)bis(e) (,) in(e)i(f)m\\u00ed(g)ci(f) no(gfhg)stri :(g.) (:) l\\u00ed(e)be(-fg)ra(ghGF) nos(fe__) De(f)us(f) Is(gfg)ra(DE!gv_FEf)el(fe..) (;) ex(f) \\u00f3(fd__)mni(d)bus(dsfss/gddc__) (,) an(ce~)g\\u00fa(ec__/d!ewffv)sti(d!fo!gv)is(g) no(gf__//hvGFgv_FE)stris.(e.) (::) <i>Ps.</i> Ad(hg~) te(gh) D\\u00f3(h)mi(h)ne(h) le(h)v\\u00e1(h)vi(h) \\u00e1(hg)ni(gi)mam(i>) me(hi)am :(h.) *(:) De(hg)us(gh) me(h)us(h) in(h) te(h) con(h)f\\u00ed(hi)do,(h) (`) non(h) e(hf)ru(gh)b\\u00e9(g)scam.(e.) (::) Gl\\u00f3(hg)ri(gh)a(h) Pa(h)tri.(h) (::) E(h) u(h) o(hf) u(gh) a(g) e.(e/gff) (::)\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'I have type-set this chant to more accurately reflect the Swiss neumes of Einsiedeln 121 and have restored a number of notes from F to their original position on E. I have not yet added the nabc for the Einsiedeln notation.\n\nSquare note source: 1974 Graduale Romanum/Triplex\nEinsiedeln source: codex 121, page 108 (https://e-codices.unifr.ch/en/sbe/0121/108)\nLaon source: codex 239, page 45 (https://imslp.org/wiki/Gradual,_F-LA_Ms_239_(Gregorian_Chant))', 0, NULL),
(18408, '203984', NULL, 'Propter verba', 1, 'an', '6', 'f', NULL, '', NULL, '\"(c4)Prop(f)ter(g) ver(hg~)ba(f) *() la(h)bi(g)\\u00f3(f)rum(d) tu(e)\\u00f3(d)rum(c) e(c)go(d) cu(f)sto(fg)d\\u00ed(g)vi(gf) vi(g)as(ghg) du(f)ras.(f) (::)\\r\\n\"', NULL, NULL, 'Got this from a random manuscript I found online', 0, NULL),
(18409, '006919a', NULL, 'Non sunt loquelæ', 1, 're', '1', 'g2', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)Non(h) sunt(hghggf) lo(g)qu\\u00e9(gh)l\\u00e6(g) *() ne(hf)que(gh) ser(g)m\\u00f3(hih)nes(h) quo(hf)rum(gh) non(h) au(h)di(h)\\u00e1n(h)tur(h) vo(hghg)ces(hf) e(f/ghghjh)\\u00f3(hGFEgh)rum.(gf) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Absolutely bizarre antiphon, every manuscript agrees but this one is weird regardless.\n12th Resp. of Monastic Matins, Comm. Apostolorum.', 0, NULL),
(18410, NULL, NULL, 'Cum fortis armatus', 1, NULL, '3', 'a', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)Cum(g) for(gj)tis(h) ar(g/h\'jh~)m\\u00e1(ij)tus(i\'_[oh:h]) *(,) cu(i)st\\u00f3(i\')dit(j) \\u00e1(k\')tri(j)um(h\') su(h)um,(g.) (;) in(g_[uh:l]h) pa(j\')ce(i) sunt(g!hwi_[oh:h]g~) \\u00f3(h)mni(gf)a(f) quae(e_[uh:l]f) p\\u00f3s(g)si(f)det.(e.) (::) <eu>E(j) u(j) o(j) u(h) a(j) e.</eu>(ih..) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'Just a copy paste of dum fortis armatus but for the 1910 Breviary which replaces \"dum\" with \"cum\"', 0, NULL);
INSERT INTO `gregobase_chants` (`id`, `cantusid`, `version`, `incipit`, `initial`, `office-part`, `mode`, `mode_var`, `transcriber`, `commentary`, `headers`, `gabc`, `gabc_verses`, `tex_verses`, `remarks`, `copyrighted`, `duplicateof`) VALUES
(18411, NULL, 'Reconstruction', 'Victimae paschali laudes', 1, 'se', '1', NULL, 'Sancti Fructuosi', NULL, NULL, '\"(c4) Al(c[alt:Cantor:])le(f)l\\u00fa(ed~){ia}.(d.) *(;) (dcdfgfed.,hgegfed.) (::)\\r\\n()  Vi(d[alt: 2 Chori:])cti(c)mae(d) pa(f)sch\\u00e1(g)li(f) lau(e)des(d.) (,) \\u00edm(h)mo(g)lent(e) Chri(g)sti(f)\\u00e1(e)ni.(d.) (::Z) \\r\\nA (h[alt:Cantor:]j khghh.,hg hgfed.,fg dedc. efed.) (::) A(h[alt:Chorus 1:] )gnus(j) red(k)\\u00e9(h)mit(g) o(h)ves :(h.) (;) Chri(h)stus(g) \\u00edn(h)no(g)cens(f) Pa(e)tri(d.) (,) re(f)con(g)ci(d)li(e)\\u00e1(d)vit(c.z) pec(e)ca(f)t\\u00f3(e)res.(d.) (::)  Mors(h[alt:Chorus 2:]) et(j) vi(k)ta(h) du(g)\\u00e9l(h)lo(h.) (,) con(h)fli(g)x\\u00e9(h)re(g) mi(f)r\\u00e1n(e)do :(d.) (;) dux(f) vi(g)tae(d) m\\u00f3r(e)tu(d)us,(c.) re(e)gnat(f) vi(e)vus.(d.) (::Z) \\r\\n A (a[alt:Cantor:] cd fg e_[oh:h]d, c fede cd.:f hg hfg fe~ d.; d gfghgfg fe~ d.::)\\r\\n Dic(a[alt:Chorus 1:]) no(c)bis(d) Ma(f)r\\u00ed(g)a,(e_[oh:h]d) (,) quid(c) vi(f)d\\u00ed(e)sti(d) in(e) vi(c)a?(d.) (:) Se(f)p\\u00fal(h)crum(g) Chri(h)sti(f) vi(g)v\\u00e9n(fe~)tis,(d.) (;) et(d) gl\\u00f3(g)ri(f)am(g) vi(h)di(g) re(f)sur(g)g\\u00e9n(fe~)tis :(d.) (::)\\r\\n An(a[alt:Chorus 2:])g\\u00e9(c)li(d)cos(f) te(g)stes,(e_[oh:h]d) (,) su(c)d\\u00e1(f)ri(e)um,(d) et(e) ve(c)stes.(d.) (:) Sur(f)r\\u00e9(h)xit(g) Chri(h)stus(f) spes(g) me(fe)a :(d.) (;) prae(d)c\\u00e9(g)det(f) su(g)os(h) in(g) Ga(f)li(g)la\\u00e9(fe)am.(d.) (::Z)\\r\\n A (h[alt:Cantor:]j khghh.,hj hgfed., cfe gh h.,fg fed. ::)\\r\\nCre(h[alt:Chorus 1:])d\\u00e9n(j)dum(k) est(h) ma(h)gis(g) so(h)li(h.) (,) Ma(h)r\\u00ed(j)\\u00e6(g) ve(f)r\\u00e1(e)ci(d.) (;) quam(c) Ju(f)d\\u00e6(e)\\u00f3(g)rum(h) Tur(h)b\\u00e6(f) fal(g)l\\u00e1(fe)ci.(d.) (::)\\r\\n Sci(h[alt:Chorus 2:])mus(j) Chri(k)stum(h) sur(h)re(g)x\\u00eds(h)se(h.) (,) a(h) m\\u00f3r(j)tu(g)is(f) ve(e)re :(d.) (;) tu(c) no(f)bis,(e) vi(g)ctor(h) Rex,(h.) (,) mi(f)se(g)r\\u00e9(fe)re.(d.) (::)  A(ded[alt:2 Chori:])men.(cd..) (::Z) \\r\\n Al(c[alt:Omnes:])le(f)l\\u00fa(ed~){ia}.(d. dcdfgfed.,hgegfed. ; hj khghh.,hg hgfed.,fg dedc. efed. ; a cd fg e_[oh:h]d, c fede cd. ; f hg hfg fe~ d.; d gfghgfg fe~ d.; hj khghh.,hj hgfed., cfe gh h.,fg fed. ::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'This is a contemporary speculation of what an original version would have been, with two choirs alternating with the Aleluia \"jubilus\".', 0, NULL),
(18412, NULL, 'Portugal', 'Resurrexi', 1, 'in', '4', 'A', 'Sancti Fructuosi', NULL, NULL, '\"(c3)Res(i)su(h)sci(i)tei(ji.) *(;) e(ir) estou convo- sco(h) pa(i)ra(j) sem(h)pre;(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n2. Por(i) to(hi)dos(ir) os lados me(ih) en(hj)vol(j)ve(ij)is(i.) *(;) e(ir) sobre mim pon(h)des(i) a(j) vos(h)sa(f) m\\u00e3o.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n3. Pro(i)di(hi)gi(ir)osa ci\\u00eancia, que(i) n\\u00e3o(i) pos(i)so(ih) com(hj)pre(j)en(ij)der,(i.) *(;) t\\u00e3o(ir) sublime que(i) a(i) n\\u00e3o(h) pos(i)so(j) al(h)can(f)\\u00e7ar!(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n4. Se(i) su(hi)bir(ir) ao c\\u00e9u,(ih) V\\u00f3s(hj) l\\u00e1(j) e(ij)stais;(i.) *(;) se(ir) descer aos abismos, ali Vos(h) en(i)con(j)tra(h)is.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n5. Se(i) vo(hi)ar(i) nas(i) a(i)sas(ih) da(hj) au(j)ro(ij)ra,(i.) *(;) se(ir) habitar nos confins do(h) o(i)ce(j)a(h)no,(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n6. mes(i)mo(hi) a(ir)li a vossa m\\u00e3o me(ih) gu(hj)ia(j)r\\u00e1(iji.___) *(;) e(ir) a vossa direita me(i) su(h)sten(i)ta(j)r\\u00e1.(hf..)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n7. V\\u00f3s(i) for(hi)ma(ir)stes as entranhas do(ih) me(hj)u(j) cor(ij)po(i.) *(;) e(ir) me criastes no se(h)io(i) de(j) min(h)ha(f) m\\u00e3e.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n8. E(i)u(hi) Vos dou gra\\u00e7as por me haverdes feito t\\u00e3o mara(ir)vil(ih)ho(hj)sa(j)men(ij)te:(i.) *(:) admir\\u00e1veis s\\u00e3o(ir) as(h) vos(i)sas(j) o(h)bras.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n9. Gl\\u00f3(i)ri(hi)a(i) ao (i) Pai,(ih) e(hj) ao(j) Fi(iji)lho,(i.) *(:) e(i) Es(i)p\\u00ed(h)ri(i)tu(j) San(h)to.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\\r\\n10. Si(i)cut(hi) e(i)rat(i) in(i) prin(i)c\\u00ed(i)pi(i)o,(i) et(ih) nunc,(hj) et(j) sem(ij)per,(i.) *(:) et(i) in(i) s\\u01fd(i)cu(i)la(i) s\\u00e6(i)cu(h)l\\u00f3(i)rum.(j) A(h)men.(f.)(;) A(g)le(egf)lu(fhg)ia:(gf..)  (::)(Z)\"', NULL, NULL, 'The portuguese liturgical version of Psalm 138 (139) transformed in a responsorial chant for the beginning of Easter Day Mass.\nMelodic motifs are taken from the original introit \"Resurrexi\" from the Graduale Romanum.', 0, NULL),
