(18626, NULL, 'Engelberg', 'O Maria rubens rosa', 1, 'al', '3', NULL, 'Christopher Jasper', NULL, NULL, '\"annotation: All.\\r\\nannotation: III\\r\\n%%\\r\\n(c4)Al(e>)le(efEDe///ijIHGhhvGFE)l\\u00fa(deDC)ia.(de!fvEDe) (,) (i!j!kle////ijIHGhhvGFE///de!fvEDevDCde!fvEDe) (::) O(efEDe///ijIHGhhvGFE//deDC) Ma(d)r\\u00ed(efED)a,(e) (;) ru(l>)bens(lkki) ro(jvIHGh)sa(he), de(c)li(d)c\\u00e1(e)tum(fvED) l\\u00ed(f)li(ghGFgvEC//de!fvED)um;(e) (:) dul(lk~)cis(i), mi(jvIHGh)tis,(he) et(g) for(c>)m\\u00f3(de!fvED)sa,(e) (;) sum(c>)mum(d) ce(e)li(fvED) g\\u00e1u(f)di(ghGFggvEC//de!fvED)um;(e) (:) tu(l) cel(ij~)la(k) Chri(g)sti(h) lu(g)ci(hi!jvIH)da(i) tu,(e) (,) vi(g)tis(g) co(hvGF)pi(gf)\\u00f3(efED)sa;(e) (:) ex(i>)\\u00e1u(jvIHGh>)di(fe) nos(de) m\\u00ed(i)se(j)ros,(kj/kle) (,) et(c) o(d)ra(e) pro(gvFE) no(fvED)bis.(e) (:) Pi(efEDe///ij!kvli//jjg//iic///de!fvED)a(e) (,) et(g) per(hg~)duc(fe) nos(de) ad(c>) f\\u00ed(d)li(e)um(gvFE) tu(fvED)um,(e) (,) Vir(ijIHGh>)go(fe) Ma(cd)r\\u00ed(efEDe)a.(e) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, 'This particular version comes from the 14th c. Engelberg Codex. Since the manuscript of this version is unavailable online, it has been transcribed from the only known recording (at time of this writing) by the Schola Cantorum Basiliensis, directed by Dominique Vellard. However, in support of this are two older manuscript versions which are available online:\n\n13th c. Klosterneuburg, Augustiner-Chorherrenstift, Cod. 588: https://manuscripta.at/diglit/AT5000-588/0301?sid=d68bd1d6a0aac7bb39d99954bc6343e1\n\n12th c. St Gallen codex 338: https://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/csg/0338/257/0/Sequence-485', 0, NULL),
(18627, NULL, 'Solesmes 1895', 'Magi veniunt', 1, 're', '8', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"(c4)Ma(f!gh)gi(g) (::) v\\u00e9(gh)ni(g)unt(g) ab(g) O(g)ri(g!hi)\\u00e9n(hg)te(hjg/hggf) Je(f)ro(h)s\\u00f3(jj)ly(hg)mam,(g) (;) qu\\u00e6(h)r\\u00e9n(ixhiHGFgh)tes,(g) et(g) di(ghjvjvIHiwj/IH)c\\u00e9n(gh@ivHGh)tes:(hg) (:) U(jkj)bi(jh) est(jki) qui(jk) na(ki/jk)tus(h!iwjIHGh) est,(hg) (:) cu(ixf/hih)jus(hg) stel(j)lam(hj) v\\u00ed(ji/jvIHG)di(hg/hvGFg)mus?(gf) (:) * Et(gh) v\\u00e9(g)ni(gefvEDe)mus(ed) a(fe)do(fg)r\\u00e1(g)re(ghjvjvIHiwj/IH) D\\u00f3(g)mi(gh@ivHGh)num.(hg) (::) <sp>V/</sp>. V\\u00ed(gj)di(ji)mus(jkj/ijIHGhg) stel(ij)lam(hi) e(g/hih)jus(hg) (:) in(ixhjHGhih) O(gf)ri(gh)\\u00e9n(hji/jkJIH)te.(h/ivHGhg) (::) * Et(gh) v\\u00e9(g)ni(gefvEDe)mus.(ed) (::)\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL);
